local RS=game:GetService("ReplicatedStorage"); local SSS=game:GetService("ServerScriptService"); local SPS=game:GetService("StarterPlayer"):WaitForChild("StarterPlayerScripts"); local function folder(parent,name) local old=parent:FindFirstChild(name) if old then old:Destroy() end local f=Instance.new("Folder") f.Name=name f.Parent=parent return f end; local function put(parent,name,class,source) local s=Instance.new(class) s.Name=name s.Source=source s.Parent=parent end; local shared=folder(RS,"GuessAndDraw"); local server=folder(SSS,"GuessAndDraw"); local client=folder(SPS,"GuessAndDraw"); put(shared,"Config","ModuleScript","-- Shared settings for the server and every client. Tweak the game here.\n\nlocal Config = {}\n\n-- Match structure ----------------------------------------------------------\n\n-- A match is a batch of rounds. In each round every player draws once.\nConfig.ROUNDS_PER_MATCH = 3\nConfig.MIN_PLAYERS = 2\n\n-- Phase lengths, in seconds.\nConfig.STARTING_TIME = 8 -- countdown before a match begins\nConfig.CHOOSE_TIME = 15 -- drawer picks a word\nConfig.DRAW_TIME = 80 -- everyone else guesses\nConfig.TURN_END_TIME = 6 -- word reveal between turns\nConfig.MATCH_END_TIME = 12 -- winners screen\n\nConfig.WORD_CHOICES = 3\n\n-- A letter of the word is revealed once this fraction of the draw time has passed.\nConfig.HINT_FRACTIONS = { 0.5, 0.75 }\n\n-- Scoring --------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nConfig.MAX_GUESS_POINTS = 300 -- guessing instantly\nConfig.MIN_GUESS_POINTS = 50 -- guessing in the last second\nConfig.FIRST_GUESS_BONUS = 50\nConfig.DRAWER_POINTS_PER_GUESS = 50\n\n-- When false the game is UI-only: nobody gets an avatar in the 3D world.\nConfig.SPAWN_CHARACTERS = false\n\n-- Look & sound -------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n-- Upload the files in the assets folder (see the README), then paste each asset ID\n-- between the quotes, like \"rbxassetid://1234567890\". Empty ones are skipped: no\n-- background picture (just the green), or no sound.\nConfig.BACKGROUND_IMAGE = \"rbxassetid://107099391291442\" -- your background.jpeg\n\n-- \"Fill\" shows the picture once, covering the whole screen.\n-- \"Tile\" repeats it and slowly scrolls it. Only use \"Tile\" with an image that\n-- repeats seamlessly, like assets/background-tile.png.\nConfig.BACKGROUND_STYLE = \"Fill\"\n\nConfig.SOUNDS = {\n\tclick = \"\", -- assets/sounds/click.ogg\n\ttick = \"\", -- assets/sounds/tick.ogg\n\tcorrect = \"\", -- assets/sounds/correct.ogg\n\tyourTurn = \"\", -- assets/sounds/your-turn.ogg\n\ttimeUp = \"\", -- assets/sounds/time-up.ogg\n\tvictory = \"\", -- assets/sounds/victory.ogg\n}\n\nConfig.BACKGROUND_TILE_SIZE = 420 -- \"Tile\" only: on-screen size of one tile, in pixels\nConfig.BACKGROUND_SCROLL_SPEED = 12 -- \"Tile\" only: pixels per second; 0 keeps it still\nConfig.SOUND_VOLUME = 0.5\n\n-- Canvas ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nConfig.CANVAS_ASPECT = 4 / 3 -- width / height\nConfig.BACKGROUND_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\n\n-- Colour index 0 is the eraser (paints the background colour).\nConfig.COLORS = {\n\t{ name = \"Black\", color = Color3.fromRGB(20, 20, 20) },\n\t{ name = \"Gray\", color = Color3.fromRGB(128, 128, 128) },\n\t{ name = \"Red\", color = Color3.fromRGB(230, 41, 41) },\n\t{ name = \"Orange\", color = Color3.fromRGB(255, 140, 0) },\n\t{ name = \"Yellow\", color = Color3.fromRGB(255, 221, 0) },\n\t{ name = \"Green\", color = Color3.fromRGB(0, 160, 60) },\n\t{ name = \"Blue\", color = Color3.fromRGB(30, 90, 230) },\n\t{ name = \"White\", color = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255) },\n\t{ name = \"Light gray\", color = Color3.fromRGB(200, 200, 200) },\n\t{ name = \"Brown\", color = Color3.fromRGB(130, 80, 40) },\n\t{ name = \"Pink\", color = Color3.fromRGB(255, 130, 190) },\n\t{ name = \"Lime\", color = Color3.fromRGB(120, 230, 60) },\n\t{ name = \"Sky blue\", color = Color3.fromRGB(80, 200, 255) },\n\t{ name = \"Purple\", color = Color3.fromRGB(140, 60, 200) },\n}\n\n-- Brush diameters as a fraction of the canvas width.\nConfig.BRUSH_SIZES = { 0.006, 0.012, 0.024, 0.045 }\nConfig.DEFAULT_BRUSH_SIZE = 2\n\n-- Networking -------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nConfig.SEND_INTERVAL = 0.05 -- how often the drawer streams new points\nConfig.MIN_POINT_DISTANCE = 0.002 -- skip points closer than this (canvas widths)\nConfig.MAX_NUMBERS_PER_PACKET = 600 -- x,y pairs count as two numbers\nConfig.MAX_PACKETS_PER_SECOND = 40\nConfig.MAX_STROKES = 3000\nConfig.MAX_TOTAL_NUMBERS = 80000\n\nreturn Config\n"); put(shared,"Words","ModuleScript","-- Words the drawer can be offered. Add or remove freely; keep them easy to draw.\n\nreturn {\n\t\"apple\", \"banana\", \"pizza\", \"burger\", \"ice cream\", \"cake\", \"cookie\", \"donut\", \"carrot\", \"cheese\",\n\t\"egg\", \"grapes\", \"watermelon\", \"pineapple\", \"popcorn\", \"sandwich\", \"taco\", \"hot dog\", \"cupcake\", \"lemon\",\n\t\"cat\", \"dog\", \"fish\", \"bird\", \"horse\", \"cow\", \"pig\", \"sheep\", \"rabbit\", \"turtle\",\n\t\"snake\", \"frog\", \"elephant\", \"giraffe\", \"lion\", \"monkey\", \"penguin\", \"shark\", \"octopus\", \"spider\",\n\t\"butterfly\", \"bee\", \"snail\", \"owl\", \"duck\", \"dinosaur\", \"dragon\", \"unicorn\", \"whale\", \"crab\",\n\t\"house\", \"castle\", \"bridge\", \"tower\", \"lighthouse\", \"tent\", \"igloo\", \"school\", \"church\", \"pyramid\",\n\t\"car\", \"bus\", \"train\", \"airplane\", \"rocket\", \"boat\", \"bicycle\", \"helicopter\", \"tractor\", \"submarine\",\n\t\"sun\", \"moon\", \"star\", \"cloud\", \"rain\", \"rainbow\", \"snowman\", \"tree\", \"flower\", \"mountain\",\n\t\"volcano\", \"island\", \"beach\", \"river\", \"cactus\", \"mushroom\", \"leaf\", \"tornado\", \"lightning\", \"fire\",\n\t\"phone\", \"computer\", \"television\", \"camera\", \"clock\", \"lamp\", \"key\", \"lock\", \"door\", \"window\",\n\t\"chair\", \"table\", \"bed\", \"toothbrush\", \"umbrella\", \"glasses\", \"hat\", \"shoe\", \"sock\", \"shirt\",\n\t\"crown\", \"ring\", \"backpack\", \"scissors\", \"pencil\", \"book\", \"envelope\", \"gift\", \"balloon\", \"kite\",\n\t\"guitar\", \"drum\", \"piano\", \"trumpet\", \"microphone\", \"headphones\", \"robot\", \"ghost\", \"alien\", \"pirate\",\n\t\"wizard\", \"ninja\", \"king\", \"princess\", \"zombie\", \"vampire\", \"superhero\", \"astronaut\", \"clown\", \"mermaid\",\n\t\"football\", \"basketball\", \"baseball\", \"tennis\", \"skateboard\", \"trophy\", \"medal\", \"sword\", \"shield\", \"bow\",\n\t\"heart\", \"eye\", \"nose\", \"hand\", \"foot\", \"tooth\", \"brain\", \"skeleton\", \"smile\", \"beard\",\n\t\"candle\", \"bell\", \"anchor\", \"compass\", \"map\", \"treasure\", \"flag\", \"ladder\", \"hammer\", \"magnet\",\n\t\"bucket\", \"broom\", \"spoon\", \"fork\", \"knife\", \"cup\", \"teapot\", \"bottle\", \"basket\", \"bone\",\n\t\"snowflake\", \"planet\", \"comet\", \"earth\", \"volleyball\", \"bowling\", \"fishing rod\", \"campfire\", \"spider web\", \"snowball\",\n\t\"birthday\", \"christmas tree\", \"pumpkin\", \"witch\", \"scarecrow\", \"bat\", \"nest\", \"egg timer\", \"sandcastle\", \"jellyfish\",\n}\n"); put(server,"GameServer","Script","-- Runs the guess-and-draw game: matches of rounds, turns, scoring, guess checking,\n-- and relaying the drawer's strokes to everyone else live.\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal TextService = game:GetService(\"TextService\")\n\nlocal Shared = ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"GuessAndDraw\")\nlocal Config = require(Shared:WaitForChild(\"Config\"))\nlocal Words = require(Shared:WaitForChild(\"Words\"))\n\nPlayers.CharacterAutoLoads = Config.SPAWN_CHARACTERS\n\n-- Remotes ----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal remotes = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\nremotes.Name = \"GuessAndDrawRemotes\"\n\nlocal function makeRemote(name: string): RemoteEvent\n\tlocal remote = Instance.new(\"RemoteEvent\")\n\tremote.Name = name\n\tremote.Parent = remotes\n\treturn remote\nend\n\nlocal StateEvent = makeRemote(\"State\") -- S->C: game snapshot\nlocal DrawEvent = makeRemote(\"Draw\") -- C->S: drawer's points; S->C: relayed points\nlocal CanvasEvent = makeRemote(\"Canvas\") -- C->S: undo/clear/ready; S->C: undo/clear\nlocal ChatEvent = makeRemote(\"Chat\") -- S->C: chat and system lines\nlocal GuessEvent = makeRemote(\"Guess\") -- C->S: a guess or chat message\nlocal WordChoiceEvent = makeRemote(\"WordChoice\") -- S->C: options; C->S: chosen index\nremotes.Parent = ReplicatedStorage\n\n-- State ------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal state = {\n\tphase = \"Waiting\", -- Waiting, Starting, Choosing, Drawing, TurnEnd, MatchEnd\n\tround = 0,\n\tphaseEndsAt = 0,\n\tdrawer = nil :: Player?,\n\tword = nil :: string?,\n\twordOptions = nil :: { string }?,\n\trevealed = {} :: { [number]: boolean },\n\tturnStartedAt = 0,\n\tguessed = {} :: { [Player]: boolean },\n\tguessCount = 0,\n\tturnPoints = {} :: { [Player]: number },\n\tlastTurn = nil :: any,\n\twinners = nil :: any,\n}\n\nlocal scores: { [Player]: number } = {}\nlocal usedWords: { [string]: boolean } = {}\nlocal readyPlayers: { [Player]: boolean } = {}\n\n-- Strokes of the current turn, kept so late joiners see the whole drawing.\nlocal strokes: { { id: number, c: number, s: number, p: { number } } } = {}\nlocal strokesById: { [number]: any } = {}\nlocal totalNumbers = 0\nlocal drawRate: { [Player]: { windowStart: number, count: number } } = {}\nlocal lastGuessAt: { [Player]: number } = {}\n\nlocal function now(): number\n\treturn workspace:GetServerTimeNow()\nend\n\nlocal function isPresent(player: Player?): boolean\n\treturn player ~= nil and player.Parent == Players\nend\n\n-- Words --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function normalize(text: string): string\n\treturn (string.gsub(string.lower(text), \"[^%w]\", \"\"))\nend\n\nlocal function isLetter(char: string): boolean\n\treturn string.match(char, \"%w\") ~= nil\nend\n\nlocal function maskedWord(): string\n\tlocal word = state.word or \"\"\n\tlocal out = table.create(#word)\n\tfor i = 1, #word do\n\t\tlocal char = string.sub(word, i, i)\n\t\tout[i] = if isLetter(char) and not state.revealed[i] then \"_\" else char\n\tend\n\treturn table.concat(out)\nend\n\nlocal function revealRandomLetter()\n\tlocal word = state.word\n\tif not word then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal hidden = {}\n\tfor i = 1, #word do\n\t\tif isLetter(string.sub(word, i, i)) and not state.revealed[i] then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(hidden, i)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\t-- Always leave at least two letters hidden so the hint never gives it away.\n\tif #hidden > 2 then\n\t\tstate.revealed[hidden[math.random(#hidden)]] = true\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function pickWords(count: number): { string }\n\tlocal pool = {}\n\tfor _, word in Words do\n\t\tif not usedWords[word] then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(pool, word)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tif #pool < count then\n\t\ttable.clear(usedWords)\n\t\tpool = table.clone(Words)\n\tend\n\tlocal picks = {}\n\tfor _ = 1, count do\n\t\tlocal word = table.remove(pool, math.random(#pool))\n\t\tusedWords[word] = true\n\t\ttable.insert(picks, word)\n\tend\n\treturn picks\nend\n\n-- Levenshtein distance, used to tell a guesser they are close.\nlocal function editDistance(a: string, b: string): number\n\tif math.abs(#a - #b) > 2 then\n\t\treturn 99\n\tend\n\tlocal prev = {}\n\tfor j = 0, #b do\n\t\tprev[j] = j\n\tend\n\tfor i = 1, #a do\n\t\tlocal cur = { [0] = i }\n\t\tfor j = 1, #b do\n\t\t\tlocal cost = if string.byte(a, i) == string.byte(b, j) then 0 else 1\n\t\t\tcur[j] = math.min(prev[j] + 1, cur[j - 1] + 1, prev[j - 1] + cost)\n\t\tend\n\t\tprev = cur\n\tend\n\treturn prev[#b]\nend\n\n-- Scores ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function setLeaderstat(player: Player, name: string, value: number)\n\tlocal stats = player:FindFirstChild(\"leaderstats\")\n\tlocal stat = stats and stats:FindFirstChild(name)\n\tif stat then\n\t\t(stat :: IntValue).Value = value\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function addScore(player: Player, points: number)\n\tscores[player] = (scores[player] or 0) + points\n\tstate.turnPoints[player] = (state.turnPoints[player] or 0) + points\n\tsetLeaderstat(player, \"Score\", scores[player])\nend\n\n-- Broadcasting --------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function buildSnapshot(forPlayer: Player)\n\tlocal list = {}\n\tfor _, player in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\ttable.insert(list, {\n\t\t\tuserId = player.UserId,\n\t\t\tname = player.DisplayName,\n\t\t\tscore = scores[player] or 0,\n\t\t\tguessed = state.guessed[player] == true,\n\t\t\tisDrawer = player == state.drawer,\n\t\t})\n\tend\n\ttable.sort(list, function(a, b)\n\t\tif a.score ~= b.score then\n\t\t\treturn a.score > b.score\n\t\tend\n\t\treturn a.name < b.name\n\tend)\n\n\tlocal seesWord = forPlayer == state.drawer or state.guessed[forPlayer] or state.phase == \"TurnEnd\"\n\tlocal wordDisplay = nil\n\tif state.word and (state.phase == \"Drawing\" or state.phase == \"TurnEnd\") then\n\t\twordDisplay = if seesWord then state.word else maskedWord()\n\tend\n\n\treturn {\n\t\tphase = state.phase,\n\t\tround = state.round,\n\t\ttotalRounds = Config.ROUNDS_PER_MATCH,\n\t\tphaseEndsAt = state.phaseEndsAt,\n\t\tdrawerUserId = state.drawer and state.drawer.UserId,\n\t\tdrawerName = state.drawer and state.drawer.DisplayName,\n\t\tisDrawer = forPlayer == state.drawer,\n\t\tcanDraw = forPlayer == state.drawer and state.phase == \"Drawing\",\n\t\tword = wordDisplay,\n\t\twordIsFull = seesWord == true,\n\t\tplayers = list,\n\t\tminPlayers = Config.MIN_PLAYERS,\n\t\tlastTurn = state.lastTurn,\n\t\twinners = state.winners,\n\t}\nend\n\nlocal function broadcastState()\n\tfor player in readyPlayers do\n\t\tif isPresent(player) then\n\t\t\tStateEvent:FireClient(player, buildSnapshot(player))\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function systemMessage(text: string, kind: string?, recipients: { Player }?)\n\tlocal message = { kind = kind or \"system\", text = text }\n\tif recipients then\n\t\tfor _, player in recipients do\n\t\t\tChatEvent:FireClient(player, message)\n\t\tend\n\telse\n\t\tChatEvent:FireAllClients(message)\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function filterForBroadcast(text: string, from: Player): string?\n\tlocal ok, result = pcall(function()\n\t\tlocal filtered = TextService:FilterStringAsync(text, from.UserId)\n\t\treturn filtered:GetNonChatStringForBroadcastAsync()\n\tend)\n\tif ok then\n\t\treturn result\n\tend\n\twarn(\"Text filtering failed:\", result)\n\treturn nil\nend\n\n-- Canvas ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function clearCanvas()\n\ttable.clear(strokes)\n\ttable.clear(strokesById)\n\ttotalNumbers = 0\n\tCanvasEvent:FireAllClients(\"clear\")\nend\n\nlocal function sendCanvasTo(player: Player)\n\tCanvasEvent:FireClient(player, \"clear\")\n\tlocal chunk = Config.MAX_NUMBERS_PER_PACKET\n\tfor _, stroke in strokes do\n\t\tfor start = 1, math.max(#stroke.p, 1), chunk do\n\t\t\tlocal points = table.move(stroke.p, start, math.min(start + chunk - 1, #stroke.p), 1, {})\n\t\t\tDrawEvent:FireClient(player, { id = stroke.id, c = stroke.c, s = stroke.s, p = points })\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function isInteger(value: any, min: number, max: number): boolean\n\treturn typeof(value) == \"number\" and value == value and value % 1 == 0 and value >= min and value <= max\nend\n\nDrawEvent.OnServerEvent:Connect(function(player, packet)\n\tif player ~= state.drawer or state.phase ~= \"Drawing\" or typeof(packet) ~= \"table\" then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal rate = drawRate[player]\n\tlocal t = os.clock()\n\tif not rate or t - rate.windowStart >= 1 then\n\t\trate = { windowStart = t, count = 0 }\n\t\tdrawRate[player] = rate\n\tend\n\trate.count += 1\n\tif rate.count > Config.MAX_PACKETS_PER_SECOND then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal id, c, s, p = packet.id, packet.c, packet.s, packet.p\n\tif not isInteger(id, 1, 2 ^ 31) or not isInteger(c, 0, #Config.COLORS) or not isInteger(s, 1, #Config.BRUSH_SIZES) then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tif typeof(p) ~= \"table\" or #p == 0 or #p % 2 ~= 0 or #p > Config.MAX_NUMBERS_PER_PACKET then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tif totalNumbers + #p > Config.MAX_TOTAL_NUMBERS then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal points = table.create(#p)\n\tfor i = 1, #p do\n\t\tlocal n = p[i]\n\t\tif typeof(n) ~= \"number\" or n ~= n then\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\t\tpoints[i] = math.clamp(n, 0, 1)\n\tend\n\n\tlocal stroke = strokesById[id]\n\tif not stroke then\n\t\tif #strokes >= Config.MAX_STROKES then\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\t\tstroke = { id = id, c = c, s = s, p = {} }\n\t\tstrokesById[id] = stroke\n\t\ttable.insert(strokes, stroke)\n\tend\n\ttable.move(points, 1, #points, #stroke.p + 1, stroke.p)\n\ttotalNumbers += #points\n\n\tlocal relay = { id = id, c = stroke.c, s = stroke.s, p = points }\n\tfor _, other in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\tif other ~= player and readyPlayers[other] then\n\t\t\tDrawEvent:FireClient(other, relay)\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend)\n\nCanvasEvent.OnServerEvent:Connect(function(player, action)\n\tif action == \"ready\" then\n\t\tif readyPlayers[player] then\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\t\treadyPlayers[player] = true\n\t\tStateEvent:FireClient(player, buildSnapshot(player))\n\t\tsendCanvasTo(player)\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tif player ~= state.drawer or state.phase ~= \"Drawing\" then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tif action == \"undo\" then\n\t\tlocal stroke = table.remove(strokes)\n\t\tif stroke then\n\t\t\tstrokesById[stroke.id] = nil\n\t\t\ttotalNumbers -= #stroke.p\n\t\t\tCanvasEvent:FireAllClients(\"undo\", stroke.id)\n\t\tend\n\telseif action == \"clear\" then\n\t\tclearCanvas()\n\tend\nend)\n\n-- Guesses & chat -------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function insiders(): { Player }\n\tlocal list = {}\n\tfor _, player in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\tif player == state.drawer or state.guessed[player] then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(list, player)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn list\nend\n\nGuessEvent.OnServerEvent:Connect(function(player, text)\n\tif typeof(text) ~= \"string\" then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\ttext = string.gsub(text, \"^%s+\", \"\")\n\ttext = string.gsub(text, \"%s+$\", \"\")\n\tif #text == 0 or #text > 100 then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal t = os.clock()\n\tif lastGuessAt[player] and t - lastGuessAt[player] < 0.4 then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlastGuessAt[player] = t\n\n\tlocal word = state.word\n\tif state.phase == \"Drawing\" and word then\n\t\t-- The drawer and anyone who already guessed may only talk among themselves,\n\t\t-- so they can't leak the answer.\n\t\tif player == state.drawer or state.guessed[player] then\n\t\t\tlocal filtered = filterForBroadcast(text, player)\n\t\t\tif filtered then\n\t\t\t\tlocal message = { kind = \"insider\", name = player.DisplayName, text = filtered }\n\t\t\t\tfor _, insider in insiders() do\n\t\t\t\t\tChatEvent:FireClient(insider, message)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tlocal guess, answer = normalize(text), normalize(word)\n\t\tif guess == answer then\n\t\t\tstate.guessed[player] = true\n\t\t\tstate.guessCount += 1\n\t\t\tlocal timeLeft = math.clamp((state.phaseEndsAt - now()) / Config.DRAW_TIME, 0, 1)\n\t\t\tlocal points = math.floor(\n\t\t\t\tConfig.MIN_GUESS_POINTS + (Config.MAX_GUESS_POINTS - Config.MIN_GUESS_POINTS) * timeLeft\n\t\t\t)\n\t\t\tif state.guessCount == 1 then\n\t\t\t\tpoints += Config.FIRST_GUESS_BONUS\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\taddScore(player, points)\n\t\t\tif isPresent(state.drawer) then\n\t\t\t\taddScore(state.drawer :: Player, Config.DRAWER_POINTS_PER_GUESS)\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tsystemMessage(player.DisplayName .. \" guessed the word!\", \"correct\")\n\t\t\tsystemMessage(`You guessed it! +{points} points`, \"correct\", { player })\n\t\t\tbroadcastState()\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tlocal filtered = filterForBroadcast(text, player)\n\t\tif filtered then\n\t\t\tChatEvent:FireAllClients({ kind = \"chat\", name = player.DisplayName, text = filtered })\n\t\tend\n\t\tif #answer >= 4 and editDistance(guess, answer) == 1 then\n\t\t\tsystemMessage(`'{filtered or text}' is close!`, \"close\", { player })\n\t\tend\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal filtered = filterForBroadcast(text, player)\n\tif filtered then\n\t\tChatEvent:FireAllClients({ kind = \"chat\", name = player.DisplayName, text = filtered })\n\tend\nend)\n\nWordChoiceEvent.OnServerEvent:Connect(function(player, index)\n\tif player ~= state.drawer or state.phase ~= \"Choosing\" or state.word then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal options = state.wordOptions\n\tif options and isInteger(index, 1, #options) then\n\t\tstate.word = options[index]\n\tend\nend)\n\n-- Game loop ------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function enoughPlayers(): boolean\n\treturn #Players:GetPlayers() >= Config.MIN_PLAYERS\nend\n\n-- Waits until the phase timer runs out, or until `stopEarly` returns true.\nlocal function waitPhase(duration: number, stopEarly: (() -> boolean)?)\n\tstate.phaseEndsAt = now() + duration\n\tbroadcastState()\n\twhile now() < state.phaseEndsAt do\n\t\tif stopEarly and stopEarly() then\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\t\ttask.wait(0.1)\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function everyoneGuessed(): boolean\n\tlocal guessers = 0\n\tfor _, player in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\tif player ~= state.drawer then\n\t\t\tguessers += 1\n\t\t\tif not state.guessed[player] then\n\t\t\t\treturn false\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn guessers > 0\nend\n\nlocal function runTurn(drawer: Player)\n\tstate.drawer = drawer\n\tstate.word = nil\n\tstate.revealed = {}\n\tstate.guessed = {}\n\tstate.guessCount = 0\n\tstate.turnPoints = {}\n\tstate.lastTurn = nil\n\tclearCanvas()\n\n\t-- Choosing\n\tlocal drawerGone = function()\n\t\treturn not isPresent(drawer) or not enoughPlayers()\n\tend\n\tstate.phase = \"Choosing\"\n\tstate.wordOptions = pickWords(Config.WORD_CHOICES)\n\tWordChoiceEvent:FireClient(drawer, state.wordOptions)\n\twaitPhase(Config.CHOOSE_TIME, function()\n\t\treturn state.word ~= nil or drawerGone()\n\tend)\n\tif drawerGone() then\n\t\tstate.wordOptions = nil\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tif not state.word then\n\t\tlocal options = state.wordOptions :: { string }\n\t\tstate.word = options[math.random(#options)]\n\tend\n\tstate.wordOptions = nil\n\tWordChoiceEvent:FireClient(drawer, nil)\n\n\t-- Drawing\n\tstate.phase = \"Drawing\"\n\tstate.turnStartedAt = now()\n\tsystemMessage(drawer.DisplayName .. \" is drawing now!\")\n\tlocal hintsGiven = 0\n\twaitPhase(Config.DRAW_TIME, function()\n\t\tlocal elapsed = (now() - state.turnStartedAt) / Config.DRAW_TIME\n\t\tlocal nextHint = Config.HINT_FRACTIONS[hintsGiven + 1]\n\t\tif nextHint and elapsed >= nextHint then\n\t\t\thintsGiven += 1\n\t\t\trevealRandomLetter()\n\t\t\tbroadcastState()\n\t\tend\n\t\treturn drawerGone() or everyoneGuessed()\n\tend)\n\n\t-- Turn end\n\tlocal results = {}\n\tfor player, points in state.turnPoints do\n\t\tif isPresent(player) then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(results, {\n\t\t\t\tuserId = player.UserId,\n\t\t\t\tname = player.DisplayName,\n\t\t\t\tpoints = points,\n\t\t\t\tisDrawer = player == drawer,\n\t\t\t})\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\ttable.sort(results, function(a, b)\n\t\treturn a.points > b.points\n\tend)\n\tlocal allGuessed = isPresent(drawer) and everyoneGuessed()\n\tstate.lastTurn = {\n\t\tword = state.word,\n\t\tdrawerName = drawer.DisplayName,\n\t\teveryoneGuessed = allGuessed,\n\t\treason = if not isPresent(drawer)\n\t\t\tthen \"The drawer left.\"\n\t\t\telseif allGuessed then \"Everyone guessed it!\"\n\t\t\telse \"Time's up!\",\n\t\tresults = results,\n\t}\n\tstate.phase = \"TurnEnd\"\n\tsystemMessage(`The word was '{state.word}'`, \"reveal\")\n\twaitPhase(Config.TURN_END_TIME)\n\tstate.drawer = nil\n\tstate.word = nil\nend\n\nlocal function finishMatch()\n\tlocal ranking = {}\n\tfor _, player in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\ttable.insert(ranking, { player = player, score = scores[player] or 0 })\n\tend\n\ttable.sort(ranking, function(a, b)\n\t\treturn a.score > b.score\n\tend)\n\n\t-- Ties share a place; the podium shows places 1-3.\n\tlocal winners = {}\n\tlocal place = 0\n\tlocal lastScore = nil\n\tfor i, entry in ranking do\n\t\tif entry.score ~= lastScore then\n\t\t\tplace = i\n\t\t\tlastScore = entry.score\n\t\tend\n\t\tif place > 3 then\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tend\n\t\ttable.insert(winners, {\n\t\t\tplace = place,\n\t\t\tuserId = entry.player.UserId,\n\t\t\tname = entry.player.DisplayName,\n\t\t\tscore = entry.score,\n\t\t})\n\t\tif place == 1 then\n\t\t\tlocal stats = entry.player:FindFirstChild(\"leaderstats\")\n\t\t\tlocal wins = stats and stats:FindFirstChild(\"Wins\") :: IntValue?\n\t\t\tif wins then\n\t\t\t\twins.Value += 1\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tstate.winners = winners\n\n\tlocal champions = {}\n\tfor _, winner in winners do\n\t\tif winner.place == 1 then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(champions, winner.name)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tsystemMessage(`{table.concat(champions, \" & \")} won the match!`, \"correct\")\n\n\tstate.phase = \"MatchEnd\"\n\twaitPhase(Config.MATCH_END_TIME)\n\tstate.winners = nil\nend\n\n-- Returns true when every round was played, false if the match was cut short.\nlocal function runMatch(): boolean\n\ttable.clear(scores)\n\ttable.clear(usedWords)\n\tfor _, player in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\tscores[player] = 0\n\t\tsetLeaderstat(player, \"Score\", 0)\n\tend\n\n\tfor round = 1, Config.ROUNDS_PER_MATCH do\n\t\tstate.round = round\n\t\tsystemMessage(`Round {round} of {Config.ROUNDS_PER_MATCH}`)\n\t\t-- Players who join mid-round guess now and draw from the next round on.\n\t\tfor _, drawer in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\t\t\tif not enoughPlayers() then\n\t\t\t\treturn false\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tif isPresent(drawer) then\n\t\t\t\trunTurn(drawer)\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn enoughPlayers()\nend\n\nlocal function resetToWaiting()\n\tstate.phase = \"Waiting\"\n\tstate.round = 0\n\tstate.drawer = nil\n\tstate.word = nil\n\tstate.guessed = {}\n\tstate.lastTurn = nil\n\tstate.winners = nil\n\tstate.phaseEndsAt = 0\n\tbroadcastState()\nend\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n\twhile true do\n\t\tresetToWaiting()\n\t\twhile not enoughPlayers() do\n\t\t\ttask.wait(0.5)\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tstate.phase = \"Starting\"\n\t\twaitPhase(Config.STARTING_TIME, function()\n\t\t\treturn not enoughPlayers()\n\t\tend)\n\t\tif enoughPlayers() then\n\t\t\tclearCanvas()\n\t\t\tif runMatch() then\n\t\t\t\tfinishMatch()\n\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\tsystemMessage(\"Not enough players - the match was cancelled.\")\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend)\n\n-- Players ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function onPlayerAdded(player: Player)\n\tlocal stats = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\n\tstats.Name = \"leaderstats\"\n\tlocal score = Instance.new(\"IntValue\")\n\tscore.Name = \"Score\"\n\tscore.Parent = stats\n\tlocal wins = Instance.new(\"IntValue\")\n\twins.Name = \"Wins\"\n\twins.Parent = stats\n\tstats.Parent = player\n\n\tscores[player] = 0\n\tsystemMessage(`{player.DisplayName} joined the room!`, \"join\")\n\tbroadcastState()\nend\n\nPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(onPlayerAdded)\nfor _, player in Players:GetPlayers() do\n\tonPlayerAdded(player)\nend\n\nPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(function(player)\n\tsystemMessage(`{player.DisplayName} left the room!`, \"leave\")\n\tscores[player] = nil\n\treadyPlayers[player] = nil\n\tdrawRate[player] = nil\n\tlastGuessAt[player] = nil\n\tstate.guessed[player] = nil\n\tstate.turnPoints[player] = nil\n\ttask.defer(broadcastState)\nend)\n"); put(client,"Main","LocalScript","-- Builds the game screen, lets the drawer draw (streaming strokes to the server),\n-- shows everyone else the drawing live, and handles guessing/chat. The look follows\n-- skribbl.io; colours and fonts are in Theme, building blocks in Ui, sounds in\n-- Sounds, and confetti/floating text in Effects.\n\nlocal GuiService = game:GetService(\"GuiService\")\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal RunService = game:GetService(\"RunService\")\nlocal StarterGui = game:GetService(\"StarterGui\")\nlocal UserInputService = game:GetService(\"UserInputService\")\n\nlocal Config = require(ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"GuessAndDraw\"):WaitForChild(\"Config\"))\nlocal CanvasRenderer = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"CanvasRenderer\"))\nlocal Effects = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Effects\"))\nlocal Sounds = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Sounds\"))\nlocal Theme = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Theme\"))\nlocal Ui = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Ui\"))\n\nlocal make, label, title = Ui.make, Ui.label, Ui.title\n\nlocal Remotes = ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"GuessAndDrawRemotes\")\nlocal StateEvent = Remotes:WaitForChild(\"State\") :: RemoteEvent\nlocal DrawEvent = Remotes:WaitForChild(\"Draw\") :: RemoteEvent\nlocal CanvasEvent = Remotes:WaitForChild(\"Canvas\") :: RemoteEvent\nlocal ChatEvent = Remotes:WaitForChild(\"Chat\") :: RemoteEvent\nlocal GuessEvent = Remotes:WaitForChild(\"Guess\") :: RemoteEvent\nlocal WordChoiceEvent = Remotes:WaitForChild(\"WordChoice\") :: RemoteEvent\n\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\n\n-- Guesses go through this game's own chat box, so hide Roblox's chat to keep\n-- answers out of it.\ntask.spawn(function()\n\tfor _ = 1, 10 do\n\t\tlocal ok = pcall(function()\n\t\t\tStarterGui:SetCoreGuiEnabled(Enum.CoreGuiType.Chat, false)\n\t\t\tStarterGui:SetCoreGuiEnabled(Enum.CoreGuiType.Backpack, false)\n\t\tend)\n\t\tif ok then\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tend\n\t\ttask.wait(1)\n\tend\nend)\n\nlocal function clearChildren(parent: Instance)\n\tfor _, child in parent:GetChildren() do\n\t\tif child:IsA(\"GuiObject\") then\n\t\t\tchild:Destroy()\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function escapeRichText(text: string): string\n\ttext = string.gsub(text, \"&\", \"&amp;\")\n\ttext = string.gsub(text, \"<\", \"&lt;\")\n\ttext = string.gsub(text, \">\", \"&gt;\")\n\treturn text\nend\n\nlocal function colorTag(color: Color3, text: string): string\n\treturn `<font color=\"#{color:ToHex()}\">{text}</font>`\nend\n\n-- Each letter in a different colour, like the skribbl.io logo.\nlocal function rainbowText(text: string): string\n\tlocal parts = {}\n\tlocal index = 0\n\tfor _, code in utf8.codes(text) do\n\t\tlocal char = utf8.char(code)\n\t\tif char == \" \" then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(parts, \" \")\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tindex += 1\n\t\t\ttable.insert(parts, colorTag(Theme.rainbow[(index - 1) % #Theme.rainbow + 1], escapeRichText(char)))\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn table.concat(parts)\nend\n\n-- Screen & background ---------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal screen = make(\"ScreenGui\", {\n\tName = \"GuessAndDraw\",\n\tResetOnSpawn = false,\n\t-- Lay out in full-window pixels, the same space as GetMouseLocation(), so the\n\t-- pointer maps onto the canvas with no topbar offset.\n\tIgnoreGuiInset = true,\n\tZIndexBehavior = Enum.ZIndexBehavior.Sibling,\n\tParent = player:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\"),\n})\n\nlocal background = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tName = \"Background\",\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.background,\n\tBorderSizePixel = 0,\n\tClipsDescendants = true,\n\tZIndex = 0,\n\tParent = screen,\n})\n\nif Config.BACKGROUND_IMAGE ~= \"\" then\n\tlocal tiled = Config.BACKGROUND_STYLE == \"Tile\"\n\tlocal tile = Config.BACKGROUND_TILE_SIZE\n\tlocal image = make(\"ImageLabel\", {\n\t\t-- A tiled image is one tile larger than the screen so it can scroll seamlessly.\n\t\tSize = if tiled then UDim2.new(1, tile, 1, tile) else UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\tImage = Config.BACKGROUND_IMAGE,\n\t\tScaleType = if tiled then Enum.ScaleType.Tile else Enum.ScaleType.Crop,\n\t\tTileSize = UDim2.fromOffset(tile, tile),\n\t\tParent = background,\n\t})\n\tif tiled and Config.BACKGROUND_SCROLL_SPEED > 0 then\n\t\tRunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function()\n\t\t\tlocal offset = (os.clock() * Config.BACKGROUND_SCROLL_SPEED) % tile\n\t\t\timage.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(-offset, -offset)\n\t\tend)\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal root = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tZIndex = 1,\n\tParent = screen,\n}, {\n\t-- Keep the game clear of Roblox's topbar buttons.\n\tmake(\"UIPadding\", { PaddingTop = UDim.new(0, GuiService:GetGuiInset().Y) }),\n})\n\nlocal effectsLayer = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tName = \"Effects\",\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tZIndex = 10,\n\tParent = screen,\n})\nEffects.init(effectsLayer)\n\n-- Like skribbl.io's fixed-width page, the whole game sits in one centred box. It is\n-- designed at 1500x889 pixels and shrinks to fit smaller screens; `box` turns\n-- design-pixel rectangles into positions and sizes inside it.\nlocal DESIGN = Vector2.new(1500, 889)\n\nlocal game_ = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tName = \"Game\",\n\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.5),\n\tSize = UDim2.new(1, -24, 1, -16),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tParent = root,\n}, {\n\tmake(\"UIAspectRatioConstraint\", { AspectRatio = DESIGN.X / DESIGN.Y }),\n\tmake(\"UISizeConstraint\", { MaxSize = DESIGN }),\n})\n\nlocal function box(x: number, y: number, width: number, height: number): (UDim2, UDim2)\n\treturn UDim2.fromScale(x / DESIGN.X, y / DESIGN.Y), UDim2.fromScale(width / DESIGN.X, height / DESIGN.Y)\nend\n\n-- Logo -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal LOGO_TEXT = \"Guess & Draw\"\nlocal logoPosition, logoSize = box(4, 0, 470, 72)\nlocal logo = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tPosition = logoPosition,\n\tSize = logoSize,\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tParent = game_,\n})\n-- A dark copy behind the letters gives the chunky drop shadow.\nlabel({\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromOffset(3, 4),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.86, 1),\n\tText = LOGO_TEXT,\n\tFontFace = Theme.logo,\n\tTextColor3 = Theme.outline,\n\tTextTransparency = 0.35,\n\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,\n\tParent = logo,\n}, { Ui.textOutline(3, Theme.outline) })\nlabel({\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.86, 1),\n\tRichText = true,\n\tText = rainbowText(LOGO_TEXT),\n\tFontFace = Theme.logo,\n\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,\n\tParent = logo,\n}, { Ui.textOutline(3, Theme.outline) })\nlocal logoPencil = label({\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.86, 0),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.14, 1),\n\tText = \"\226\156\143\239\184\143\",\n\tRotation = 10,\n\tParent = logo,\n})\nUi.loop(logoPencil, 1.2, { Rotation = -10 })\n\n-- Top bar: alarm clock, round, word, sound toggle ----------------------------------------\n\nlocal topPosition, topSize = box(0, 80, 1500, 54)\nlocal topBar = Ui.panel({ Position = topPosition, Size = topSize, Parent = game_ })\n\n-- A little alarm clock drawn from circles, bigger than the bar like skribbl.io's.\nlocal clock = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0, 0.5),\n\tPosition = UDim2.new(0, 4, 0.5, 0),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1.35),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tParent = topBar,\n}, { Ui.square() })\n\nfor _, side in { -1, 1 } do\n\tmake(\"Frame\", { -- bell\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5 + side * 0.32, 0.14),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.32, 0.32),\n\t\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.white,\n\t\tZIndex = 1,\n\t\tParent = clock,\n\t}, { Ui.round(), Ui.border(3, Theme.outline) })\n\tmake(\"Frame\", { -- leg\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5 + side * 0.26, 0.92),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.07, 0.2),\n\t\tRotation = side * -35,\n\t\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.outline,\n\t\tZIndex = 1,\n\t\tParent = clock,\n\t}, { Ui.round() })\nend\n\nlocal clockFace = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.54),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.84, 0.84),\n\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.white,\n\tZIndex = 2,\n\tParent = clock,\n}, { Ui.round(), Ui.border(3, Theme.outline) })\n\nlocal timerLabel = label({\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\tFontFace = Theme.heavy,\n\tText = \"\",\n\tParent = clockFace,\n}, { Ui.pad(7) })\n\nlocal roundLabel = label({\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.06, 0.2),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.22, 0.6),\n\tFontFace = Theme.bold,\n\tText = \"\",\n\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,\n\tParent = topBar,\n}, { Ui.maxText(24) })\n\nlocal wordArea = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0),\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.44, 1),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tParent = topBar,\n})\n\nlocal wordCaption = label({\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.1),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.3),\n\tFontFace = Theme.mono,\n\tText = \"\",\n\tParent = wordArea,\n}, { Ui.maxText(15) })\n\nlocal wordLabel = label({\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.38),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.56),\n\tFontFace = Theme.monoBold,\n\tText = \"\",\n\tParent = wordArea,\n}, { Ui.maxText(28) })\n\n-- Where skribbl.io has its settings gear: a sound on/off switch.\nlocal soundButton = make(\"TextButton\", {\n\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0.5),\n\tPosition = UDim2.new(1, -8, 0.5, 0),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.8),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tText = \"\240\159\148\138\",\n\tTextScaled = true,\n\tParent = topBar,\n}, { Ui.square() })\nUi.hoverable(soundButton)\nsoundButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\tSounds.muted = not Sounds.muted\n\tsoundButton.Text = if Sounds.muted then \"\240\159\148\135\" else \"\240\159\148\138\"\n\tSounds.play(\"click\")\nend)\n\n-- Left: players ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal MAIN_TOP = 142\nlocal CANVAS_HEIGHT = 675\n\nlocal playersPosition, playersSize = box(0, MAIN_TOP, 230, CANVAS_HEIGHT)\nlocal playersList = make(\"ScrollingFrame\", {\n\tPosition = playersPosition,\n\tSize = playersSize,\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tBorderSizePixel = 0,\n\tScrollBarThickness = 4,\n\tCanvasSize = UDim2.new(),\n\tAutomaticCanvasSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y,\n\tParent = game_,\n}, {\n\tmake(\"UIListLayout\", { SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder }),\n})\n\n-- Centre: canvas and toolbar ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal canvasPosition, canvasSize = box(238, MAIN_TOP, 900, CANVAS_HEIGHT)\nlocal canvasArea = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tPosition = canvasPosition,\n\tSize = canvasSize,\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tParent = game_,\n})\n\n-- Every layer over the canvas shares the same centred 4:3 box.\nlocal function canvasLayer(className: string, props: { [string]: any }, children: { Instance }?): any\n\tlocal list = children or {}\n\ttable.insert(list, make(\"UIAspectRatioConstraint\", { AspectRatio = Config.CANVAS_ASPECT }))\n\tlocal defaults = {\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\tParent = canvasArea,\n\t}\n\tfor key, value in props do\n\t\tdefaults[key] = value\n\tend\n\treturn make(className, defaults, list)\nend\n\n-- A CanvasGroup clips rotated children, which a plain Frame with ClipsDescendants doesn't.\nlocal canvas = canvasLayer(\"CanvasGroup\", {\n\tName = \"Canvas\",\n\tBackgroundColor3 = Config.BACKGROUND_COLOR,\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 0,\n\tActive = true,\n\tZIndex = 1,\n}, { Ui.corner(4) })\n\n-- Replaces the mouse pointer over the canvas: a dot the size and colour of the brush,\n-- centred exactly where the line will be drawn. It sits on its own layer so moving\n-- it doesn't make the CanvasGroup re-render every stroke.\nlocal cursorLayer = canvasLayer(\"Frame\", { ClipsDescendants = true, ZIndex = 2 })\n\nlocal cursorDot = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\tBorderSizePixel = 0,\n\tVisible = false,\n\tParent = cursorLayer,\n}, {\n\tUi.round(),\n\tmake(\"UIStroke\", { Color = Color3.fromRGB(90, 90, 90), Thickness = 1 }),\n\tmake(\"UISizeConstraint\", { MinSize = Vector2.new(5, 5) }),\n})\n\nlocal renderer = CanvasRenderer.new(canvas)\n\n-- The dark overlay on the canvas for waiting / choosing / reveal / winners. Its\n-- content slides down from the top, as on skribbl.io.\nlocal overlay = canvasLayer(\"Frame\", {\n\tName = \"Overlay\",\n\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.overlay,\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 0.2,\n\tClipsDescendants = true,\n\tZIndex = 3,\n}, { Ui.corner(4) })\n\nlocal overlayContent = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tParent = overlay,\n}, { Ui.pad(20) })\n\nlocal overlayTitle = title({\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.06),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.13),\n\tText = \"\",\n\tParent = overlayContent,\n}, { Ui.maxText(46) })\n\nlocal overlaySubtitle = label({\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.2),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.07),\n\tText = \"\",\n\tTextColor3 = Theme.overlayText,\n\tParent = overlayContent,\n}, { Ui.maxText(24) })\n\nlocal overlayBody = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.32),\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.66),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tParent = overlayContent,\n})\n\n-- Below the canvas: the drawing tools, shown only to the drawer.\nlocal toolbarPosition, toolbarSize = box(238, MAIN_TOP + CANVAS_HEIGHT + 8, 900, 64)\nlocal toolbar = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tPosition = toolbarPosition,\n\tSize = toolbarSize,\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tVisible = false,\n\tParent = game_,\n}, {\n\tmake(\"UIListLayout\", {\n\t\tFillDirection = Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal,\n\t\tHorizontalAlignment = Enum.HorizontalAlignment.Center,\n\t\tVerticalAlignment = Enum.VerticalAlignment.Center,\n\t\tPadding = UDim.new(0, 8),\n\t\tSortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder,\n\t}),\n})\n\n-- Right: chat ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal chatPosition, chatSize = box(1146, MAIN_TOP, 354, CANVAS_HEIGHT)\nlocal chatPanel = Ui.panel({ Position = chatPosition, Size = chatSize, Parent = game_ })\n\nlocal chatLog = make(\"ScrollingFrame\", {\n\tSize = UDim2.new(1, 0, 1, -50),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tBorderSizePixel = 0,\n\tScrollBarThickness = 4,\n\tCanvasSize = UDim2.new(),\n\tAutomaticCanvasSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y,\n\tParent = chatPanel,\n}, {\n\t-- New messages stack up from the bottom, like skribbl.io.\n\tmake(\"UIListLayout\", {\n\t\tSortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder,\n\t\tVerticalAlignment = Enum.VerticalAlignment.Bottom,\n\t}),\n})\n\nlocal guessBorder = Ui.border(1, Theme.border)\nlocal guessBox = make(\"TextBox\", {\n\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0, 1),\n\tPosition = UDim2.new(0, 6, 1, -6),\n\tSize = UDim2.new(1, -12, 0, 36),\n\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.white,\n\tTextColor3 = Theme.text,\n\tPlaceholderText = \"Type your guess here...\",\n\tPlaceholderColor3 = Theme.muted,\n\tText = \"\",\n\tFontFace = Theme.regular,\n\tTextSize = 17,\n\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,\n\tClearTextOnFocus = false,\n\tParent = chatPanel,\n}, { Ui.corner(4), Ui.pad(8, 4), guessBorder })\n\nguessBox.Focused:Connect(function()\n\tguessBorder.Color = Theme.you\n\tguessBorder.Thickness = 2\nend)\n\n-- Game state ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal snapshot: any = nil\nlocal wordChoices: { string }? = nil\nlocal chosenWord: string? = nil\n\nlocal selectedColor = 1\nlocal selectedSize = Config.DEFAULT_BRUSH_SIZE\nlocal erasing = false\n\n-- Chat -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal chatOrder = 0\nlocal MAX_CHAT_LINES = 120\n\n-- skribbl.io's chat colours: green for good news, orange for leaving, blue for turns.\nlocal CHAT_STYLES = {\n\tchat = { text = Theme.text },\n\tinsider = { text = Theme.green },\n\tsystem = { text = Theme.blue, bold = true },\n\treveal = { text = Theme.green, bold = true },\n\tjoin = { text = Theme.green, bold = true },\n\tleave = { text = Theme.orange, bold = true },\n\tcorrect = { text = Theme.green, bg = Theme.greenBg, bold = true },\n\tclose = { text = Theme.closeText, bg = Theme.closeBg, bold = true },\n}\n\nlocal function addChatLine(message)\n\tchatOrder += 1\n\tlocal style = CHAT_STYLES[message.kind] or CHAT_STYLES.chat\n\tlocal body = escapeRichText(message.text)\n\tlocal text = if message.name then `<b>{escapeRichText(message.name)}:</b> {body}` else body\n\n\tlocal line = label({\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0),\n\t\tAutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y,\n\t\tRichText = true,\n\t\tText = text,\n\t\tTextScaled = false,\n\t\tTextSize = 17,\n\t\tTextWrapped = true,\n\t\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,\n\t\tFontFace = if style.bold then Theme.bold else Theme.regular,\n\t\tTextColor3 = style.text,\n\t\tTextTransparency = 1,\n\t\tBackgroundColor3 = style.bg or (if chatOrder % 2 == 0 then Theme.rowAlt else Theme.white),\n\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 0,\n\t\tLayoutOrder = chatOrder,\n\t\tParent = chatLog,\n\t}, { Ui.pad(6, 5) })\n\tUi.tween(line, 0.2, { TextTransparency = 0 })\n\n\tif message.kind == \"close\" then\n\t\tSounds.play(\"tick\")\n\tend\n\n\tlocal lines = {}\n\tfor _, child in chatLog:GetChildren() do\n\t\tif child:IsA(\"TextLabel\") then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(lines, child)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tif #lines > MAX_CHAT_LINES then\n\t\ttable.sort(lines, function(a, b)\n\t\t\treturn a.LayoutOrder < b.LayoutOrder\n\t\tend)\n\t\tfor i = 1, #lines - MAX_CHAT_LINES do\n\t\t\tlines[i]:Destroy()\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\ttask.defer(function()\n\t\tchatLog.CanvasPosition = Vector2.new(0, chatLog.AbsoluteCanvasSize.Y)\n\tend)\nend\n\nChatEvent.OnClientEvent:Connect(addChatLine)\n\nguessBox.FocusLost:Connect(function(enterPressed)\n\tguessBorder.Color = Theme.border\n\tguessBorder.Thickness = 1\n\tif not enterPressed then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal text = guessBox.Text\n\tguessBox.Text = \"\"\n\tif string.match(text, \"%S\") then\n\t\tGuessEvent:FireServer(text)\n\tend\n\ttask.defer(function()\n\t\tguessBox:CaptureFocus()\n\tend)\nend)\n\n-- Toolbar ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal currentColor = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\tLayoutOrder = 1,\n\tParent = toolbar,\n}, { Ui.square(), Ui.corner(6), Ui.border(3, Theme.white) })\n\n-- 7 x 2 palette squares packed edge to edge.\nlocal palette = make(\"Frame\", {\n\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(7 * 32 / 900, 1),\n\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\tLayoutOrder = 2,\n\tParent = toolbar,\n}, {\n\tmake(\"UIGridLayout\", {\n\t\tCellSize = UDim2.fromScale(1 / 7, 0.5),\n\t\tCellPadding = UDim2.new(),\n\t\tSortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder,\n\t}),\n})\n\nlocal refreshToolbar: () -> ()\n\nlocal swatchMarks: { [number]: Frame } = {}\nfor index, entry in Config.COLORS do\n\tlocal swatch = make(\"TextButton\", {\n\t\tName = entry.name,\n\t\tText = \"\",\n\t\tAutoButtonColor = false,\n\t\tBackgroundColor3 = entry.color,\n\t\tBorderSizePixel = 0,\n\t\tLayoutOrder = index,\n\t\tParent = palette,\n\t})\n\t-- A ring marking the selected colour: dark on light colours, white on dark ones.\n\tlocal _, saturation, value = entry.color:ToHSV()\n\tlocal light = value > 0.8 and saturation < 0.5\n\tswatchMarks[index] = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\tVisible = false,\n\t\tParent = swatch,\n\t}, { Ui.square(), Ui.round(), Ui.border(2, if light then Theme.outline else Theme.white) })\n\tswatch.MouseEnter:Connect(function()\n\t\tswatch.BackgroundColor3 = entry.color:Lerp(Theme.white, 0.25)\n\tend)\n\tswatch.MouseLeave:Connect(function()\n\t\tswatch.BackgroundColor3 = entry.color\n\tend)\n\tswatch.Activated:Connect(function()\n\t\tselectedColor = index\n\t\terasing = false\n\t\tSounds.play(\"click\", 0.5)\n\t\trefreshToolbar()\n\tend)\nend\n\nlocal sizeButtons: { [number]: TextButton } = {}\nfor index, size in Config.BRUSH_SIZES do\n\tlocal sizeButton = Ui.toolButton({ LayoutOrder = 2 + index, Parent = toolbar })\n\tlocal dotScale = math.clamp(size / Config.BRUSH_SIZES[#Config.BRUSH_SIZES], 0.12, 0.7)\n\tmake(\"Frame\", {\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(dotScale, dotScale),\n\t\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.outline,\n\t\tParent = sizeButton,\n\t}, { Ui.round() })\n\tsizeButtons[index] = sizeButton\n\tsizeButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\t\tselectedSize = index\n\t\trefreshToolbar()\n\tend)\nend\n\nlocal function iconButton(icon: string, order: number): TextButton\n\tlocal button = Ui.toolButton({ LayoutOrder = 10 + order, Parent = toolbar })\n\tlabel({ Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1), Text = icon, Parent = button }, { Ui.pad(10) })\n\treturn button\nend\n\nlocal penButton = iconButton(\"\226\156\143\239\184\143\", 1)\nlocal eraserButton = iconButton(\"\240\159\167\189\", 2)\nlocal undoButton = iconButton(\"\226\134\169\239\184\143\", 3)\nlocal clearButton = iconButton(\"\240\159\151\145\239\184\143\", 4)\n\npenButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\terasing = false\n\trefreshToolbar()\nend)\neraserButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\terasing = true\n\trefreshToolbar()\nend)\nundoButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\tCanvasEvent:FireServer(\"undo\")\nend)\nclearButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\tCanvasEvent:FireServer(\"clear\")\nend)\n\nfunction refreshToolbar()\n\tcurrentColor.BackgroundColor3 = if erasing then Config.BACKGROUND_COLOR else Config.COLORS[selectedColor].color\n\tfor index, mark in swatchMarks do\n\t\tmark.Visible = not erasing and index == selectedColor\n\tend\n\tfor index, sizeButton in sizeButtons do\n\t\tsizeButton.BackgroundColor3 = if index == selectedSize then Theme.selected else Theme.white\n\tend\n\tpenButton.BackgroundColor3 = if erasing then Theme.white else Theme.selected\n\teraserButton.BackgroundColor3 = if erasing then Theme.selected else Theme.white\nend\n\nrefreshToolbar()\n\n-- Drawing input -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal strokeCounter = 0\nlocal activeStroke: { id: number, c: number, s: number, lastX: number, lastY: number }? = nil\nlocal activeInput: InputObject? = nil\nlocal pending: { number } = {}\nlocal sendTimer = 0\n\nlocal function canDraw(): boolean\n\treturn snapshot ~= nil and snapshot.canDraw == true\nend\n\n-- Pointer position in full-window pixels, the space the ScreenGui is laid out in.\nlocal function pointerPosition(input: InputObject?): Vector2\n\tif input and input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.Touch then\n\t\t-- Touch positions are measured from below the topbar; shift them into window space.\n\t\treturn Vector2.new(input.Position.X, input.Position.Y) + GuiService:GetGuiInset()\n\tend\n\treturn UserInputService:GetMouseLocation()\nend\n\n-- Returns the point as canvas fractions (clamped to the canvas) and whether it is inside it.\nlocal function toCanvas(position: Vector2): (number, number, boolean)\n\tlocal relative = (position - canvas.AbsolutePosition) / canvas.AbsoluteSize\n\tlocal inside = relative.X >= 0 and relative.X <= 1 and relative.Y >= 0 and relative.Y <= 1\n\treturn math.clamp(relative.X, 0, 1), math.clamp(relative.Y, 0, 1), inside\nend\n\nlocal function flush()\n\tlocal stroke = activeStroke\n\tif stroke and #pending > 0 then\n\t\tDrawEvent:FireServer({ id = stroke.id, c = stroke.c, s = stroke.s, p = pending })\n\t\tpending = {}\n\tend\n\tsendTimer = 0\nend\n\nlocal function addPoint(x: number, y: number)\n\tlocal stroke = activeStroke\n\tif not stroke then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\ttable.insert(pending, x)\n\ttable.insert(pending, y)\n\trenderer:addPoints(stroke.id, stroke.c, stroke.s, { x, y })\n\tstroke.lastX, stroke.lastY = x, y\n\tif #pending >= Config.MAX_NUMBERS_PER_PACKET then\n\t\tflush()\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function endStroke()\n\tflush()\n\tactiveStroke = nil\n\tactiveInput = nil\nend\n\nlocal function isPress(input: InputObject): boolean\n\treturn input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 or input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.Touch\nend\n\n-- Listening on UserInputService (not the canvas) means the layers on top of the\n-- canvas can never swallow the press.\nUserInputService.InputBegan:Connect(function(input)\n\tif activeStroke or not canDraw() or not isPress(input) then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal x, y, inside = toCanvas(pointerPosition(input))\n\tif not inside then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tstrokeCounter += 1\n\tactiveInput = input\n\tactiveStroke = {\n\t\tid = strokeCounter,\n\t\tc = if erasing then 0 else selectedColor,\n\t\ts = selectedSize,\n\t\tlastX = x,\n\t\tlastY = y,\n\t}\n\tpending = {}\n\taddPoint(x, y)\nend)\n\nUserInputService.InputChanged:Connect(function(input)\n\tlocal stroke = activeStroke\n\tif not stroke then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal isMouseDrag = input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseMovement\n\t\tand (activeInput :: InputObject).UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1\n\tif not isMouseDrag and input ~= activeInput then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal x, y = toCanvas(pointerPosition(input))\n\tlocal dx = x - stroke.lastX\n\tlocal dy = (y - stroke.lastY) / Config.CANVAS_ASPECT\n\tif dx * dx + dy * dy >= Config.MIN_POINT_DISTANCE * Config.MIN_POINT_DISTANCE then\n\t\taddPoint(x, y)\n\tend\nend)\n\nUserInputService.InputEnded:Connect(function(input)\n\tlocal stroke = activeStroke\n\tif not stroke or not (input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton1 or input == activeInput) then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\t-- Finish exactly where the pointer was released.\n\tlocal x, y = toCanvas(pointerPosition(input))\n\tif x ~= stroke.lastX or y ~= stroke.lastY then\n\t\taddPoint(x, y)\n\tend\n\tendStroke()\nend)\n\nlocal mouseHidden = false\n\nRunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function()\n\tlocal x, y, inside = toCanvas(UserInputService:GetMouseLocation())\n\tlocal showDot = canDraw() and UserInputService.MouseEnabled and (inside or activeStroke ~= nil)\n\n\tif showDot ~= mouseHidden then\n\t\tmouseHidden = showDot\n\t\tUserInputService.MouseIconEnabled = not showDot\n\tend\n\tcursorDot.Visible = showDot\n\tif showDot then\n\t\tlocal size = Config.BRUSH_SIZES[selectedSize]\n\t\tcursorDot.Position = UDim2.fromScale(x, y)\n\t\tcursorDot.Size = UDim2.fromScale(size, size * Config.CANVAS_ASPECT)\n\t\tcursorDot.BackgroundColor3 = if erasing then Config.BACKGROUND_COLOR else Config.COLORS[selectedColor].color\n\tend\nend)\n\nRunService.Heartbeat:Connect(function(dt)\n\tif activeStroke then\n\t\tsendTimer += dt\n\t\tif sendTimer >= Config.SEND_INTERVAL then\n\t\t\tflush()\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend)\n\n-- Canvas updates from the server ----------------------------------------------------------------\n\nDrawEvent.OnClientEvent:Connect(function(packet)\n\trenderer:addPoints(packet.id, packet.c, packet.s, packet.p)\nend)\n\nCanvasEvent.OnClientEvent:Connect(function(action, id)\n\tif action == \"clear\" then\n\t\trenderer:clear()\n\telseif action == \"undo\" then\n\t\trenderer:removeStroke(id)\n\tend\nend)\n\n-- Players list ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\ntype Row = {\n\tframe: Frame,\n\trank: TextLabel,\n\tname: TextLabel,\n\tscore: TextLabel,\n\tpencil: TextLabel,\n}\n\nlocal rows: { [number]: Row } = {}\n\n-- A skribbl.io player row: rank top-left, name and points centred, avatar on the right.\nlocal function createRow(entry): Row\n\tlocal frame = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\tSize = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 56),\n\t\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.white,\n\t\tBorderSizePixel = 0,\n\t\tParent = playersList,\n\t})\n\tlocal rank = label({\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromOffset(7, 5),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromOffset(40, 20),\n\t\tTextScaled = false,\n\t\tTextSize = 16,\n\t\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,\n\t\tText = \"\",\n\t\tParent = frame,\n\t})\n\tlocal name = label({\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.new(0, 34, 0, 8),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.new(1, -94, 0, 20),\n\t\tTextScaled = false,\n\t\tTextSize = 16,\n\t\tTextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd,\n\t\tText = \"\",\n\t\tParent = frame,\n\t})\n\tlocal score = label({\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.new(0, 34, 0, 28),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.new(1, -94, 0, 18),\n\t\tTextScaled = false,\n\t\tTextSize = 14,\n\t\tFontFace = Theme.regular,\n\t\tText = \"\",\n\t\tParent = frame,\n\t})\n\tUi.avatar(entry.userId, entry.name, {\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.new(1, -4, 0.5, 0),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromOffset(50, 50),\n\t\tParent = frame,\n\t})\n\tlocal pencil = label({\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.new(1, -54, 0.5, 0),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromOffset(22, 22),\n\t\tText = \"\226\156\143\239\184\143\",\n\t\tVisible = false,\n\t\tParent = frame,\n\t})\n\tUi.pop(frame, 0.7, 0.3)\n\treturn { frame = frame, rank = rank, name = name, score = score, pencil = pencil }\nend\n\nlocal function renderPlayers(list)\n\tlocal seen = {}\n\tfor position, entry in list do\n\t\tseen[entry.userId] = true\n\t\tlocal row = rows[entry.userId] or createRow(entry)\n\t\trows[entry.userId] = row\n\t\tlocal isMe = entry.userId == player.UserId\n\t\trow.frame.LayoutOrder = position\n\t\trow.rank.Text = `#{position}`\n\t\trow.name.Text = entry.name .. (if isMe then \" (You)\" else \"\")\n\t\trow.name.TextColor3 = if isMe then Theme.you else Theme.text\n\t\trow.score.Text = `{entry.score} points`\n\t\trow.pencil.Visible = entry.isDrawer\n\t\tlocal bg = if entry.guessed\n\t\t\tthen Theme.guessedRow\n\t\t\telseif entry.isDrawer then Theme.drawerRow\n\t\t\telseif position % 2 == 0 then Theme.rowAlt\n\t\t\telse Theme.white\n\t\tif row.frame.BackgroundColor3 ~= bg then\n\t\t\tUi.tween(row.frame, 0.3, { BackgroundColor3 = bg })\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tfor userId, row in rows do\n\t\tif not seen[userId] then\n\t\t\trow.frame:Destroy()\n\t\t\trows[userId] = nil\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\n-- Overlay screens -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal countdownLabel: TextLabel? = nil\n\nlocal function overlayHeader(titleText: string, subtitleText: string?)\n\toverlayTitle.Text = titleText\n\toverlaySubtitle.Text = subtitleText or \"\"\nend\n\n-- Shows `gui` after `delay` seconds with a springy pop.\nlocal function popLater(gui: GuiObject, delay: number, from: number?)\n\tUi.scaleOf(gui).Scale = 0\n\ttask.delay(delay, function()\n\t\tif gui.Parent then\n\t\t\tUi.pop(gui, from or 0.3)\n\t\tend\n\tend)\nend\n\nlocal function wobblingEmoji(emoji: string)\n\tlocal icon = label({\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.4),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.55),\n\t\tText = emoji,\n\t\tRotation = -12,\n\t\tParent = overlayBody,\n\t}, { Ui.maxText(96) })\n\tUi.loop(icon, 0.9, { Rotation = 12 })\nend\n\nlocal function renderWordChoices()\n\tlocal choices = wordChoices\n\tif not choices then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal row = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.12),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.22),\n\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\tParent = overlayBody,\n\t}, {\n\t\tmake(\"UIListLayout\", {\n\t\t\tFillDirection = Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal,\n\t\t\tHorizontalAlignment = Enum.HorizontalAlignment.Center,\n\t\t\tPadding = UDim.new(0.03, 0),\n\t\t\tSortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder,\n\t\t}),\n\t})\n\tfor index, word in choices do\n\t\tlocal choice = Ui.overlayButton({\n\t\t\tText = word,\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.26, 1),\n\t\t\tLayoutOrder = index,\n\t\t\tParent = row,\n\t\t})\n\t\tpopLater(choice, (index - 1) * 0.1)\n\t\tchoice.Activated:Connect(function()\n\t\t\tWordChoiceEvent:FireServer(index)\n\t\t\twordChoices = nil\n\t\t\tchosenWord = word\n\t\t\tclearChildren(overlayBody)\n\t\t\toverlayHeader(\"Get ready to draw!\", word)\n\t\t\twobblingEmoji(\"\226\156\143\239\184\143\")\n\t\tend)\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function renderTurnResults(lastTurn)\n\tlocal list = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.2, 0),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.6, 1),\n\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\tParent = overlayBody,\n\t}, {\n\t\tmake(\"UIListLayout\", {\n\t\t\tPadding = UDim.new(0.02, 0),\n\t\t\tHorizontalAlignment = Enum.HorizontalAlignment.Center,\n\t\t\tSortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder,\n\t\t}),\n\t})\n\n\tif #lastTurn.results == 0 then\n\t\tlocal nobody = title({ Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.14), Text = \"Nobody guessed it!\", TextColor3 = Theme.red, Parent = list }, { Ui.maxText(26) })\n\t\tpopLater(nobody, 0.3)\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tfor i, result in lastTurn.results do\n\t\tif i > 7 then\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tend\n\t\tlocal resultRow = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.12),\n\t\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\t\tLayoutOrder = i,\n\t\t\tParent = list,\n\t\t})\n\t\ttitle({\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.7, 1),\n\t\t\tText = result.name .. (if result.isDrawer then \" \226\156\143\239\184\143\" else \"\"),\n\t\t\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left,\n\t\t\tParent = resultRow,\n\t\t}, { Ui.maxText(24) })\n\t\ttitle({\n\t\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0),\n\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0),\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.3, 1),\n\t\t\tText = `+{result.points}`,\n\t\t\tTextColor3 = Theme.green,\n\t\t\tTextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Right,\n\t\t\tParent = resultRow,\n\t\t}, { Ui.maxText(24) })\n\t\tpopLater(resultRow, 0.2 + i * 0.08)\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal PODIUM = {\n\t{ place = 2, height = 0.42, color = Theme.silver, delay = 0.4 },\n\t{ place = 1, height = 0.58, color = Theme.gold, delay = 0.8 },\n\t{ place = 3, height = 0.3, color = Theme.bronze, delay = 0 },\n}\n\nlocal function renderPodium(winners)\n\tlocal row = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.1, 0),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.8, 1),\n\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\tParent = overlayBody,\n\t}, {\n\t\tmake(\"UIListLayout\", {\n\t\t\tFillDirection = Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal,\n\t\t\tHorizontalAlignment = Enum.HorizontalAlignment.Center,\n\t\t\tVerticalAlignment = Enum.VerticalAlignment.Bottom,\n\t\t\tPadding = UDim.new(0.03, 0),\n\t\t\tSortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder,\n\t\t}),\n\t})\n\tfor order, slot in PODIUM do\n\t\tlocal names, score, userId = {}, 0, nil\n\t\tfor _, winner in winners do\n\t\t\tif winner.place == slot.place then\n\t\t\t\ttable.insert(names, winner.name)\n\t\t\t\tscore = winner.score\n\t\t\t\tuserId = userId or winner.userId\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\t\tlocal column = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.3, 1),\n\t\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\t\tLayoutOrder = order,\n\t\t\tParent = row,\n\t\t})\n\t\tif #names > 0 then\n\t\t\t-- The block grows up from the floor, carrying the winner's avatar and name on top.\n\t\t\tlocal block = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\t\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0, 1),\n\t\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 1),\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0),\n\t\t\t\tBackgroundColor3 = slot.color,\n\t\t\t\tParent = column,\n\t\t\t}, { Ui.corner(6) })\n\t\t\ttitle({\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.6),\n\t\t\t\tText = `#{slot.place}`,\n\t\t\t\tTextColor3 = Theme.outline,\n\t\t\t\tParent = block,\n\t\t\t}, { Ui.maxText(40), Ui.pad(6) })\n\t\t\tlabel({\n\t\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.55),\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.3),\n\t\t\t\tText = `{score} points`,\n\t\t\t\tTextColor3 = Theme.outline,\n\t\t\t\tParent = block,\n\t\t\t}, { Ui.maxText(20), Ui.pad(4) })\n\n\t\t\tlocal plate = make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\t\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 1),\n\t\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.new(0.5, 0, 1, -4),\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.4),\n\t\t\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\t\t\tParent = column,\n\t\t\t})\n\t\t\tlocal avatar = Ui.avatar(userId, names[1], {\n\t\t\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0),\n\t\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.1),\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.62, 0.6),\n\t\t\t\tParent = plate,\n\t\t\t})\n\t\t\tUi.square().Parent = avatar\n\t\t\tif slot.place == 1 then\n\t\t\t\tlabel({\n\t\t\t\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\t\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.08),\n\t\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.4, 0.25),\n\t\t\t\t\tText = \"\240\159\145\145\",\n\t\t\t\t\tRotation = -10,\n\t\t\t\t\tParent = plate,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\ttitle({\n\t\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0, 0.72),\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.26),\n\t\t\t\tText = table.concat(names, \" & \"),\n\t\t\t\tParent = plate,\n\t\t\t}, { Ui.maxText(22) })\n\n\t\t\ttask.delay(slot.delay, function()\n\t\t\t\tUi.tween(block, 0.6, { Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, slot.height) }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back)\n\t\t\t\tUi.tween(plate, 0.6, { Position = UDim2.new(0.5, 0, 1 - slot.height, -4) }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back)\n\t\t\t\tif slot.place == 1 then\n\t\t\t\t\ttask.delay(0.6, function()\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUi.pulse(avatar, 1.3)\n\t\t\t\t\tend)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal overlayKey: string? = nil\nlocal overlayPhase: string? = nil\nlocal overlayShown = true\n\nlocal function setOverlayShown(show: boolean)\n\tif show == overlayShown then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\toverlayShown = show\n\tif show then\n\t\toverlay.Visible = true\n\t\toverlay.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n\t\tUi.tween(overlay, 0.25, { BackgroundTransparency = 0.2 })\n\telse\n\t\tUi.tween(overlay, 0.25, { BackgroundTransparency = 1 })\n\t\tUi.tween(overlayContent, 0.25, { Position = UDim2.fromScale(0, -1) }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back, Enum.EasingDirection.In).Completed:Connect(\n\t\t\tfunction()\n\t\t\t\tif not overlayShown then\n\t\t\t\t\toverlay.Visible = false\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t)\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function buildOverlay(s)\n\tlocal key = if s.phase == \"Waiting\"\n\t\tthen `Waiting{#s.players}`\n\t\telseif s.phase == \"Choosing\" then `Choosing{s.drawerUserId}{if wordChoices then \"pick\" else \"\"}{chosenWord or \"\"}`\n\t\telse `{s.phase}{s.phaseEndsAt}`\n\tif key == overlayKey then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\toverlayKey = key\n\tlocal newPhase = s.phase ~= overlayPhase\n\toverlayPhase = s.phase\n\n\tsetOverlayShown(s.phase ~= \"Drawing\")\n\tif s.phase == \"Drawing\" then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tclearChildren(overlayBody)\n\tcountdownLabel = nil\n\tif s.phase == \"Waiting\" then\n\t\toverlayHeader(\"Waiting for players...\", `{#s.players}/{s.minPlayers} players - invite a friend!`)\n\t\twobblingEmoji(\"\226\156\143\239\184\143\")\n\telseif s.phase == \"Starting\" then\n\t\toverlayHeader(\"Get ready!\", `{s.totalRounds} rounds - everyone draws once per round`)\n\t\tcountdownLabel = title({\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0.8),\n\t\t\tText = \"\",\n\t\t\tTextColor3 = Theme.yellow,\n\t\t\tParent = overlayBody,\n\t\t}, { Ui.maxText(140) })\n\telseif s.phase == \"Choosing\" then\n\t\tif s.isDrawer and wordChoices then\n\t\t\toverlayHeader(\"Choose a word\", \"\")\n\t\t\trenderWordChoices()\n\t\telseif s.isDrawer then\n\t\t\toverlayHeader(\"Get ready to draw!\", chosenWord or \"\")\n\t\t\twobblingEmoji(\"\226\156\143\239\184\143\")\n\t\telse\n\t\t\toverlayHeader(`{s.drawerName} is choosing a word!`, \"\")\n\t\t\tlocal avatar = Ui.avatar(s.drawerUserId, s.drawerName, {\n\t\t\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.3),\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(0.4, 0.55),\n\t\t\t\tRotation = -6,\n\t\t\t\tParent = overlayBody,\n\t\t\t})\n\t\t\tUi.square().Parent = avatar\n\t\t\tUi.loop(avatar, 0.8, { Rotation = 6 })\n\t\tend\n\telseif s.phase == \"TurnEnd\" and s.lastTurn then\n\t\toverlayTitle.RichText = true\n\t\toverlayHeader(`The word was {colorTag(Theme.yellow, `'{escapeRichText(s.lastTurn.word or \"\")}'`)}`, s.lastTurn.reason)\n\t\trenderTurnResults(s.lastTurn)\n\telseif s.phase == \"MatchEnd\" and s.winners then\n\t\toverlayHeader(\"Results\", \"\")\n\t\trenderPodium(s.winners)\n\tend\n\tif s.phase ~= \"TurnEnd\" then\n\t\toverlayTitle.RichText = false\n\tend\n\n\tif newPhase then\n\t\toverlayContent.Position = UDim2.fromScale(0, -0.6)\n\t\tUi.tween(overlayContent, 0.45, { Position = UDim2.new() }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back)\n\telse\n\t\toverlayContent.Position = UDim2.new()\n\tend\nend\n\n-- Rendering the game state --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal SUPERSCRIPT = { \"\226\129\176\", \"\194\185\", \"\194\178\", \"\194\179\", \"\226\129\180\", \"\226\129\181\", \"\226\129\182\", \"\226\129\183\", \"\226\129\184\", \"\226\129\185\" }\n\nlocal function superscript(n: number): string\n\treturn (string.gsub(tostring(n), \"%d\", function(digit)\n\t\treturn SUPERSCRIPT[tonumber(digit) + 1]\n\tend))\nend\n\n-- \"_ _ p _ e\" followed by the letter count of each word, like skribbl.io's \"Mac\194\179\".\nlocal function formatWord(word: string, spaced: boolean): string\n\tlocal chars = {}\n\tlocal lengths = {}\n\tlocal current = 0\n\tfor i = 1, #word do\n\t\tlocal char = string.sub(word, i, i)\n\t\tif char == \" \" then\n\t\t\ttable.insert(chars, if spaced then \"  \" else \" \")\n\t\t\ttable.insert(lengths, superscript(current))\n\t\t\tcurrent = 0\n\t\telse\n\t\t\ttable.insert(chars, char)\n\t\t\tcurrent += 1\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\ttable.insert(lengths, superscript(current))\n\treturn table.concat(chars, if spaced then \" \" else \"\") .. table.concat(lengths, \" \")\nend\n\nlocal TIMED_PHASES = { Starting = true, Choosing = true, Drawing = true, TurnEnd = true, MatchEnd = true }\nlocal toolbarShown = false\n\nlocal function render()\n\tlocal s = snapshot\n\tif not s then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\troundLabel.Text = if s.round > 0 then `Round {s.round} of {s.totalRounds}` else \"Waiting\"\n\twordLabel.TextColor3 = Theme.text\n\tif s.word and s.isDrawer then\n\t\twordCaption.Text = \"DRAW THIS\"\n\t\twordLabel.Text = formatWord(s.word, false)\n\telseif s.word and s.wordIsFull then\n\t\twordCaption.Text = if s.phase == \"TurnEnd\" then \"THE WORD WAS\" else \"YOU GOT IT!\"\n\t\twordLabel.Text = formatWord(s.word, false)\n\t\twordLabel.TextColor3 = Theme.green\n\telseif s.word then\n\t\twordCaption.Text = \"GUESS THIS\"\n\t\twordLabel.Text = formatWord(s.word, true)\n\telse\n\t\twordCaption.Text = \"WAITING\"\n\t\twordLabel.Text = \"\"\n\tend\n\n\trenderPlayers(s.players)\n\n\tif s.canDraw ~= toolbarShown then\n\t\ttoolbarShown = s.canDraw\n\t\ttoolbar.Visible = s.canDraw\n\t\tif s.canDraw then\n\t\t\tUi.pop(toolbar, 0.7, 0.3)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tif not s.canDraw and activeStroke then\n\t\tendStroke()\n\tend\n\tguessBox.PlaceholderText = if s.phase == \"Drawing\" and (s.isDrawer or s.wordIsFull)\n\t\tthen \"Chat (only players who guessed see this)\"\n\t\telse \"Type your guess here...\"\n\n\tbuildOverlay(s)\nend\n\nlocal function countHidden(word: string?): number\n\tlocal _, count = string.gsub(word or \"\", \"_\", \"\")\n\treturn count\nend\n\n-- Sounds and effects for whatever changed between two snapshots.\nlocal function celebrate(old, new)\n\tif not old then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal sameTurn = old.phase == new.phase and old.drawerUserId == new.drawerUserId\n\tif new.phase ~= old.phase then\n\t\tif new.phase == \"Drawing\" then\n\t\t\tSounds.play(\"click\")\n\t\t\tEffects.floatText(if new.isDrawer then \"Draw!\" else \"Guess!\", Theme.yellow, Effects.centreOf(canvas), 72)\n\t\telseif new.phase == \"TurnEnd\" then\n\t\t\tSounds.play(if new.lastTurn and new.lastTurn.everyoneGuessed then \"correct\" else \"timeUp\")\n\t\telseif new.phase == \"MatchEnd\" then\n\t\t\tSounds.play(\"victory\")\n\t\t\tEffects.confetti(110)\n\t\t\ttask.delay(0.8, Effects.confetti, 70)\n\t\telseif new.phase == \"Starting\" then\n\t\t\tSounds.play(\"yourTurn\", 0.6)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t-- A hint letter appeared.\n\tif sameTurn and new.phase == \"Drawing\" and not new.wordIsFull and countHidden(new.word) < countHidden(old.word) then\n\t\tUi.pulse(wordLabel, 1.3)\n\t\tSounds.play(\"click\")\n\tend\n\n\tlocal before = {}\n\tfor _, entry in old.players do\n\t\tbefore[entry.userId] = entry\n\tend\n\tfor _, entry in new.players do\n\t\tlocal previous = before[entry.userId]\n\t\tlocal row = rows[entry.userId]\n\t\tif previous and row then\n\t\t\tlocal gained = entry.score - previous.score\n\t\t\tif gained > 0 then\n\t\t\t\tUi.pulse(row.frame, 1.05)\n\t\t\t\tEffects.floatText(`+{gained}`, Theme.green, Effects.centreOf(row.frame), 28)\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tif entry.guessed and not previous.guessed then\n\t\t\t\tif entry.userId == player.UserId then\n\t\t\t\t\tSounds.play(\"correct\")\n\t\t\t\t\tUi.pulse(wordArea, 1.2)\n\t\t\t\t\tEffects.floatText(`Nice! +{gained}`, Theme.green, Effects.centreOf(canvas), 56)\n\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t\tSounds.play(\"correct\", 0.4)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nStateEvent.OnClientEvent:Connect(function(newSnapshot)\n\tlocal previous = snapshot\n\tsnapshot = newSnapshot\n\tif newSnapshot.phase ~= \"Choosing\" then\n\t\twordChoices = nil\n\t\tchosenWord = nil\n\tend\n\trender()\n\t-- Wait a frame so freshly reordered rows have their final positions.\n\ttask.defer(celebrate, previous, newSnapshot)\nend)\n\nWordChoiceEvent.OnClientEvent:Connect(function(options)\n\twordChoices = options\n\tif options then\n\t\tSounds.play(\"yourTurn\")\n\tend\n\trender()\nend)\n\n-- Timer ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal lastSecond: number? = nil\n\nRunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function()\n\tlocal s = snapshot\n\tif not (s and TIMED_PHASES[s.phase]) then\n\t\ttimerLabel.Text = \"\"\n\t\tlastSecond = nil\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal remaining = math.max(0, math.ceil(s.phaseEndsAt - workspace:GetServerTimeNow()))\n\tif remaining == lastSecond then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlastSecond = remaining\n\ttimerLabel.Text = tostring(remaining)\n\n\tlocal hurry = s.phase == \"Drawing\" and remaining <= 10 and remaining > 0\n\ttimerLabel.TextColor3 = if hurry then Theme.red else Theme.text\n\tif hurry then\n\t\tSounds.play(\"tick\")\n\t\tUi.pulse(clock, 1.15)\n\t\tUi.shake(clock, 12)\n\tend\n\n\tlocal countdown = countdownLabel\n\tif s.phase == \"Starting\" and countdown and remaining > 0 then\n\t\tcountdown.Text = tostring(remaining)\n\t\tUi.pop(countdown, 1.8, 0.3)\n\t\tSounds.play(\"tick\")\n\tend\nend)\n\n-- Entrance -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function slideIn(gui: GuiObject, from: UDim2, delay: number)\n\tlocal target = gui.Position\n\tgui.Position = target + from\n\ttask.delay(delay, function()\n\t\tUi.tween(gui, 0.6, { Position = target }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back)\n\tend)\nend\n\nslideIn(logo, UDim2.fromScale(0, -0.15), 0)\nslideIn(topBar, UDim2.fromScale(0, -0.25), 0.05)\nslideIn(playersList, UDim2.fromScale(-0.25, 0), 0.12)\nslideIn(chatPanel, UDim2.fromScale(0.3, 0), 0.18)\npopLater(canvasArea, 0.25, 0.6)\n\n-- Everything is wired up; ask the server for the current state and drawing.\nCanvasEvent:FireServer(\"ready\")\n"); put(client,"CanvasRenderer","ModuleScript","-- Draws strokes onto a canvas GuiObject using rotated, rounded Frames.\n-- Points are normalised: x and y both run 0..1 across the canvas.\n\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal Config = require(ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"GuessAndDraw\"):WaitForChild(\"Config\"))\n\n-- Canvas height measured in canvas widths, so lengths are the same in both axes.\nlocal HEIGHT_IN_WIDTHS = 1 / Config.CANVAS_ASPECT\n\nlocal CanvasRenderer = {}\nCanvasRenderer.__index = CanvasRenderer\n\nexport type Renderer = typeof(setmetatable(\n\t{} :: { canvas: GuiObject, strokes: { [number]: any }, layer: number },\n\tCanvasRenderer\n))\n\nfunction CanvasRenderer.new(canvas: GuiObject): Renderer\n\treturn setmetatable({ canvas = canvas, strokes = {}, layer = 0 }, CanvasRenderer)\nend\n\nlocal function colorFor(index: number): Color3\n\tlocal entry = Config.COLORS[index]\n\treturn if entry then entry.color else Config.BACKGROUND_COLOR\nend\n\nlocal function drawSegment(stroke, x1: number, y1: number, x2: number, y2: number)\n\tlocal dx = x2 - x1\n\tlocal dy = (y2 - y1) * HEIGHT_IN_WIDTHS\n\tlocal length = math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy)\n\tlocal thickness = stroke.thickness\n\n\tlocal segment = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n\tsegment.BorderSizePixel = 0\n\tsegment.BackgroundColor3 = stroke.color\n\tsegment.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5)\n\tsegment.Position = UDim2.fromScale((x1 + x2) / 2, (y1 + y2) / 2)\n\t-- Width covers the segment plus a round cap at each end; height is the brush diameter.\n\tsegment.Size = UDim2.fromScale(length + thickness, thickness / HEIGHT_IN_WIDTHS)\n\tsegment.Rotation = math.deg(math.atan2(dy, dx))\n\n\tlocal corner = Instance.new(\"UICorner\")\n\tcorner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0.5, 0)\n\tcorner.Parent = segment\n\n\tsegment.Parent = stroke.container\nend\n\n-- Adds points to a stroke, creating it if needed. `points` is a flat {x1, y1, x2, y2, ...}.\nfunction CanvasRenderer.addPoints(self: Renderer, id: number, colorIndex: number, sizeIndex: number, points: { number })\n\tlocal stroke = self.strokes[id]\n\tif not stroke then\n\t\tself.layer += 1\n\t\tlocal container = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n\t\tcontainer.Name = tostring(id)\n\t\tcontainer.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n\t\tcontainer.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n\t\tcontainer.ZIndex = self.layer -- later strokes paint over earlier ones\n\t\tcontainer.Parent = self.canvas\n\t\tstroke = {\n\t\t\tcontainer = container,\n\t\t\tcolor = colorFor(colorIndex),\n\t\t\tthickness = Config.BRUSH_SIZES[sizeIndex] or Config.BRUSH_SIZES[1],\n\t\t\tlastX = nil :: number?,\n\t\t\tlastY = nil :: number?,\n\t\t}\n\t\tself.strokes[id] = stroke\n\tend\n\n\tfor i = 1, #points - 1, 2 do\n\t\tlocal x, y = points[i], points[i + 1]\n\t\tif stroke.lastX then\n\t\t\tif x ~= stroke.lastX or y ~= stroke.lastY then\n\t\t\t\tdrawSegment(stroke, stroke.lastX, stroke.lastY, x, y)\n\t\t\tend\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tdrawSegment(stroke, x, y, x, y) -- a dot\n\t\tend\n\t\tstroke.lastX, stroke.lastY = x, y\n\tend\nend\n\nfunction CanvasRenderer.removeStroke(self: Renderer, id: number)\n\tlocal stroke = self.strokes[id]\n\tif stroke then\n\t\tstroke.container:Destroy()\n\t\tself.strokes[id] = nil\n\tend\nend\n\nfunction CanvasRenderer.clear(self: Renderer)\n\tfor _, stroke in self.strokes do\n\t\tstroke.container:Destroy()\n\tend\n\ttable.clear(self.strokes)\n\tself.layer = 0\nend\n\nreturn CanvasRenderer\n"); put(client,"Theme","ModuleScript","-- Colours and fonts, modelled on skribbl.io: flat white panels, Nunito text,\n-- a monospace word, and green/blue/orange chat lines.\n\nlocal function fontFace(enum: Enum.Font, weight: Enum.FontWeight?): Font\n\treturn Font.new(Font.fromEnum(enum).Family, weight or Enum.FontWeight.Regular)\nend\n\nlocal Theme = {\n\tbackground = Color3.fromRGB(59, 106, 72),\n\n\tpanel = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255),\n\trowAlt = Color3.fromRGB(236, 236, 236),\n\tborder = Color3.fromRGB(204, 204, 204),\n\ttext = Color3.fromRGB(20, 20, 20),\n\tmuted = Color3.fromRGB(110, 110, 110),\n\twhite = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255),\n\toutline = Color3.fromRGB(15, 20, 30),\n\n\tyou = Color3.fromRGB(74, 157, 230), -- your own name in the player list\n\tguessedRow = Color3.fromRGB(150, 226, 128),\n\tdrawerRow = Color3.fromRGB(255, 236, 160),\n\tselected = Color3.fromRGB(170, 120, 230), -- the active tool / brush size\n\n\toverlay = Color3.fromRGB(3, 8, 29),\n\toverlayText = Color3.fromRGB(220, 226, 240),\n\n\t-- Chat colours\n\tgreen = Color3.fromRGB(86, 206, 39),\n\tgreenBg = Color3.fromRGB(231, 255, 223),\n\tblue = Color3.fromRGB(57, 117, 206),\n\torange = Color3.fromRGB(206, 79, 10),\n\tyellow = Color3.fromRGB(255, 211, 61),\n\tcloseText = Color3.fromRGB(200, 160, 0),\n\tcloseBg = Color3.fromRGB(255, 249, 214),\n\tred = Color3.fromRGB(230, 60, 60),\n\n\tgold = Color3.fromRGB(255, 205, 50),\n\tsilver = Color3.fromRGB(200, 210, 222),\n\tbronze = Color3.fromRGB(222, 150, 92),\n\n\tregular = fontFace(Enum.Font.Nunito),\n\tbold = fontFace(Enum.Font.Nunito, Enum.FontWeight.Bold),\n\theavy = fontFace(Enum.Font.Nunito, Enum.FontWeight.ExtraBold),\n\tmono = fontFace(Enum.Font.RobotoMono),\n\tmonoBold = fontFace(Enum.Font.RobotoMono, Enum.FontWeight.Bold),\n\tlogo = fontFace(Enum.Font.FredokaOne),\n}\n\n-- Logo letters cycle through these, like skribbl.io's.\nTheme.rainbow = {\n\tColor3.fromRGB(239, 19, 11),\n\tColor3.fromRGB(255, 113, 0),\n\tColor3.fromRGB(255, 228, 0),\n\tColor3.fromRGB(0, 204, 0),\n\tColor3.fromRGB(0, 178, 255),\n\tColor3.fromRGB(35, 31, 211),\n\tColor3.fromRGB(163, 0, 186),\n\tColor3.fromRGB(223, 105, 167),\n}\n\nreturn Theme\n"); put(client,"Sounds","ModuleScript","-- Plays the UI sound effects listed in Config.SOUNDS. Sounds without an ID are skipped.\n\nlocal ContentProvider = game:GetService(\"ContentProvider\")\nlocal Debris = game:GetService(\"Debris\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal SoundService = game:GetService(\"SoundService\")\n\nlocal Config = require(ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"GuessAndDraw\"):WaitForChild(\"Config\"))\n\nlocal Sounds = {}\n\nSounds.muted = false\n\nlocal folder = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\nfolder.Name = \"GuessAndDrawSounds\"\nfolder.Parent = SoundService\n\nlocal templates: { [string]: Sound } = {}\nfor name, id in Config.SOUNDS do\n\tif typeof(id) == \"string\" and id ~= \"\" then\n\t\tlocal sound = Instance.new(\"Sound\")\n\t\tsound.Name = name\n\t\tsound.SoundId = id\n\t\tsound.Parent = folder\n\t\ttemplates[name] = sound\n\tend\nend\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n\tpcall(function()\n\t\tContentProvider:PreloadAsync(folder:GetChildren())\n\tend)\nend)\n\n-- `volume` scales Config.SOUND_VOLUME, so 0.5 plays at half the normal loudness.\nfunction Sounds.play(name: string, volume: number?)\n\tlocal template = templates[name]\n\tif not template or Sounds.muted then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\t-- A fresh copy per play lets the same sound overlap itself (fast ticks, many guesses).\n\tlocal sound = template:Clone()\n\tsound.Volume = Config.SOUND_VOLUME * (volume or 1)\n\tsound.Parent = folder\n\tsound:Play()\n\tDebris:AddItem(sound, 6)\nend\n\nreturn Sounds\n"); put(client,"Ui","ModuleScript","-- Building blocks for the UI (flat skribbl.io-style panels, text, buttons, avatars)\n-- and the small tween animations used everywhere.\n\nlocal TweenService = game:GetService(\"TweenService\")\n\nlocal Theme = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Theme\"))\nlocal Sounds = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Sounds\"))\n\nlocal Ui = {}\n\nfunction Ui.make(className: string, props: { [string]: any }, children: { Instance }?): any\n\tlocal instance = Instance.new(className)\n\tfor key, value in props do\n\t\tif key ~= \"Parent\" then\n\t\t\t(instance :: any)[key] = value\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tfor _, child in children or {} do\n\t\tchild.Parent = instance\n\tend\n\tif props.Parent then\n\t\tinstance.Parent = props.Parent\n\tend\n\treturn instance\nend\n\nlocal make = Ui.make\n\nlocal function merge(defaults: { [string]: any }, props: { [string]: any })\n\tfor key, value in props do\n\t\tdefaults[key] = value\n\tend\n\treturn defaults\nend\n\nfunction Ui.corner(radius: number?): UICorner\n\treturn make(\"UICorner\", { CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, radius or 4) })\nend\n\n-- Fully rounded ends: circles and pills.\nfunction Ui.round(): UICorner\n\treturn make(\"UICorner\", { CornerRadius = UDim.new(0.5, 0) })\nend\n\nfunction Ui.pad(pixels: number, vertical: number?): UIPadding\n\tlocal h, v = UDim.new(0, pixels), UDim.new(0, vertical or pixels)\n\treturn make(\"UIPadding\", { PaddingLeft = h, PaddingRight = h, PaddingTop = v, PaddingBottom = v })\nend\n\nfunction Ui.maxText(size: number): UITextSizeConstraint\n\treturn make(\"UITextSizeConstraint\", { MaxTextSize = size })\nend\n\nfunction Ui.square(): UIAspectRatioConstraint\n\treturn make(\"UIAspectRatioConstraint\", { AspectRatio = 1 })\nend\n\n-- Outline around a frame or button.\nfunction Ui.border(thickness: number?, color: Color3?, transparency: number?): UIStroke\n\treturn make(\"UIStroke\", {\n\t\tApplyStrokeMode = Enum.ApplyStrokeMode.Border,\n\t\tThickness = thickness or 2,\n\t\tColor = color or Theme.border,\n\t\tTransparency = transparency or 0,\n\t})\nend\n\n-- Outline around the letters of a text label.\nfunction Ui.textOutline(thickness: number?, color: Color3?): UIStroke\n\treturn make(\"UIStroke\", {\n\t\tApplyStrokeMode = Enum.ApplyStrokeMode.Contextual,\n\t\tThickness = thickness or 2,\n\t\tColor = color or Theme.outline,\n\t\tLineJoinMode = Enum.LineJoinMode.Round,\n\t})\nend\n\nfunction Ui.label(props: { [string]: any }, children: { Instance }?): TextLabel\n\treturn make(\n\t\t\"TextLabel\",\n\t\tmerge({ BackgroundTransparency = 1, TextColor3 = Theme.text, FontFace = Theme.bold, TextScaled = true }, props),\n\t\tchildren\n\t)\nend\n\n-- Big white heading text, as on the dark canvas overlay.\nfunction Ui.title(props: { [string]: any }, children: { Instance }?): TextLabel\n\treturn Ui.label(merge({ FontFace = Theme.heavy, TextColor3 = Theme.white }, props), children)\nend\n\n-- A flat white panel with slightly rounded corners.\nfunction Ui.panel(props: { [string]: any }, children: { Instance }?): Frame\n\tlocal list = children or {}\n\ttable.insert(list, Ui.corner(4))\n\treturn make(\"Frame\", merge({ BackgroundColor3 = Theme.panel, BorderSizePixel = 0 }, props), list)\nend\n\n-- Animation --------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nfunction Ui.tween(\n\tinstance: Instance,\n\tseconds: number,\n\tgoal: { [string]: any },\n\tstyle: Enum.EasingStyle?,\n\tdirection: Enum.EasingDirection?\n): Tween\n\tlocal tween = TweenService:Create(\n\t\tinstance,\n\t\tTweenInfo.new(seconds, style or Enum.EasingStyle.Quad, direction or Enum.EasingDirection.Out),\n\t\tgoal\n\t)\n\ttween:Play()\n\treturn tween\nend\n\nfunction Ui.scaleOf(gui: GuiObject): UIScale\n\tlocal scale = gui:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"UIScale\")\n\tif not scale then\n\t\tscale = make(\"UIScale\", { Parent = gui })\n\tend\n\treturn scale :: UIScale\nend\n\n-- Springs the element in from small (or large) to full size.\nfunction Ui.pop(gui: GuiObject, from: number?, seconds: number?)\n\tlocal scale = Ui.scaleOf(gui)\n\tscale.Scale = from or 0.5\n\tUi.tween(scale, seconds or 0.4, { Scale = 1 }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back)\nend\n\n-- A quick bump in size and back.\nfunction Ui.pulse(gui: GuiObject, amount: number?)\n\tlocal scale = Ui.scaleOf(gui)\n\tscale.Scale = amount or 1.2\n\tUi.tween(scale, 0.35, { Scale = 1 }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back)\nend\n\nfunction Ui.shake(gui: GuiObject, degrees: number?)\n\tlocal angle = degrees or 8\n\ttask.spawn(function()\n\t\tfor _, rotation in { angle, -angle, angle * 0.6, -angle * 0.6, 0 } do\n\t\t\tUi.tween(gui, 0.05, { Rotation = rotation }, Enum.EasingStyle.Sine).Completed:Wait()\n\t\tend\n\tend)\nend\n\n-- Loops forever between the current and the given property values.\nfunction Ui.loop(instance: Instance, seconds: number, goal: { [string]: any })\n\tTweenService:Create(\n\t\tinstance,\n\t\tTweenInfo.new(seconds, Enum.EasingStyle.Sine, Enum.EasingDirection.InOut, -1, true),\n\t\tgoal\n\t):Play()\nend\n\n-- Grows a little on hover and shrinks while pressed.\nfunction Ui.hoverable(target: GuiButton, scaleTarget: GuiObject?)\n\tlocal scale = Ui.scaleOf(scaleTarget or target)\n\tlocal hovering = false\n\ttarget.MouseEnter:Connect(function()\n\t\thovering = true\n\t\tUi.tween(scale, 0.12, { Scale = 1.06 })\n\tend)\n\ttarget.MouseLeave:Connect(function()\n\t\thovering = false\n\t\tUi.tween(scale, 0.12, { Scale = 1 })\n\tend)\n\ttarget.MouseButton1Down:Connect(function()\n\t\tUi.tween(scale, 0.08, { Scale = 0.92 })\n\tend)\n\ttarget.MouseButton1Up:Connect(function()\n\t\tUi.tween(scale, 0.2, { Scale = if hovering then 1.06 else 1 }, Enum.EasingStyle.Back)\n\tend)\nend\n\n-- Buttons ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n-- The outlined white button used on the dark canvas overlay (word choices). It\n-- fills white on hover. Takes Text plus any layout props.\nfunction Ui.overlayButton(props: { [string]: any }): TextButton\n\tlocal text = props.Text or \"\"\n\tprops.Text = \"\"\n\tlocal button = make(\n\t\t\"TextButton\",\n\t\tmerge({ BackgroundColor3 = Theme.white, BackgroundTransparency = 1, AutoButtonColor = false }, props),\n\t\t{ Ui.corner(8), Ui.border(3, Theme.white) }\n\t)\n\tlocal caption = Ui.title({ Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1), Text = text, Parent = button }, { Ui.maxText(30), Ui.pad(10, 6) })\n\tUi.hoverable(button)\n\tbutton.MouseEnter:Connect(function()\n\t\tUi.tween(button, 0.12, { BackgroundTransparency = 0 })\n\t\tUi.tween(caption, 0.12, { TextColor3 = Theme.overlay })\n\tend)\n\tbutton.MouseLeave:Connect(function()\n\t\tUi.tween(button, 0.12, { BackgroundTransparency = 1 })\n\t\tUi.tween(caption, 0.12, { TextColor3 = Theme.white })\n\tend)\n\tbutton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\t\tSounds.play(\"click\")\n\tend)\n\treturn button\nend\n\n-- A white square tool button (toolbar), holding an icon or a custom child.\nfunction Ui.toolButton(props: { [string]: any }): TextButton\n\tlocal button = make(\n\t\t\"TextButton\",\n\t\tmerge({ Text = \"\", BackgroundColor3 = Theme.white, AutoButtonColor = false, Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1) }, props),\n\t\t{ Ui.corner(6), Ui.square() }\n\t)\n\tUi.hoverable(button)\n\tbutton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\t\tSounds.play(\"click\", 0.5)\n\tend)\n\treturn button\nend\n\n-- Avatars ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n-- The player's avatar headshot. Shows their initial in a circle when there is no\n-- picture (Studio test players have no avatar).\nfunction Ui.avatar(userId: number?, name: string?, props: { [string]: any }): Frame\n\tlocal frame = make(\"Frame\", merge({ BackgroundTransparency = 1 }, props))\n\tif userId and userId > 0 then\n\t\tmake(\"ImageLabel\", {\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\t\t\tBackgroundTransparency = 1,\n\t\t\tImage = `rbxthumb://type=AvatarHeadShot&id={userId}&w=150&h=150`,\n\t\t\tParent = frame,\n\t\t})\n\telse\n\t\tmake(\"Frame\", { Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1), BackgroundColor3 = Theme.border, Parent = frame }, {\n\t\t\tUi.round(),\n\t\t\tUi.label({\n\t\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1),\n\t\t\t\tText = string.upper(string.sub(name or \"?\", 1, 1)),\n\t\t\t\tTextColor3 = Theme.white,\n\t\t\t\tFontFace = Theme.heavy,\n\t\t\t}, { Ui.pad(6) }),\n\t\t})\n\tend\n\treturn frame\nend\n\nreturn Ui\n"); put(client,"Effects","ModuleScript","-- Full-screen effects drawn on their own layer: confetti and floating \"+points\" text.\n\nlocal Debris = game:GetService(\"Debris\")\n\nlocal Theme = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Theme\"))\nlocal Ui = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Ui\"))\n\nlocal Effects = {}\n\nlocal layer: Frame? = nil\n\n-- `effectsLayer` must cover the whole screen and sit above everything else.\nfunction Effects.init(effectsLayer: Frame)\n\tlayer = effectsLayer\nend\n\nfunction Effects.confetti(count: number?)\n\tif not layer then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tfor _ = 1, count or 90 do\n\t\tlocal width = math.random(8, 15)\n\t\tlocal startX = math.random()\n\t\tlocal piece = Ui.make(\"Frame\", {\n\t\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(startX, -0.05 - math.random() * 0.35),\n\t\t\tSize = UDim2.fromOffset(width, math.floor(width * 0.6)),\n\t\t\tRotation = math.random(0, 360),\n\t\t\tBackgroundColor3 = Theme.rainbow[math.random(#Theme.rainbow)],\n\t\t\tBorderSizePixel = 0,\n\t\t\tParent = layer,\n\t\t}, { Ui.corner(2) })\n\t\tlocal seconds = 2.4 + math.random() * 1.8\n\t\tUi.tween(piece, seconds, {\n\t\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromScale(startX + (math.random() - 0.5) * 0.3, 1.1),\n\t\t\tRotation = piece.Rotation + math.random(-720, 720),\n\t\t}, Enum.EasingStyle.Sine, Enum.EasingDirection.In)\n\t\tDebris:AddItem(piece, seconds + 0.1)\n\tend\nend\n\n-- Pops up text at a screen position, then drifts it upward and fades it out.\nfunction Effects.floatText(text: string, color: Color3, position: Vector2, textSize: number?)\n\tif not layer then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal outline = Ui.textOutline(3)\n\tlocal label = Ui.label({\n\t\tAnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5),\n\t\tPosition = UDim2.fromOffset(position.X, position.Y),\n\t\tSize = UDim2.fromOffset(400, (textSize or 30) + 10),\n\t\tText = text,\n\t\tTextScaled = false,\n\t\tTextSize = textSize or 30,\n\t\tTextColor3 = color,\n\t\tFontFace = Theme.heavy,\n\t\tParent = layer,\n\t}, { outline })\n\tUi.pop(label, 0.3, 0.35)\n\ttask.delay(0.45, function()\n\t\tUi.tween(label, 0.9, { Position = UDim2.fromOffset(position.X, position.Y - 60), TextTransparency = 1 })\n\t\tUi.tween(outline, 0.9, { Transparency = 1 })\n\tend)\n\tDebris:AddItem(label, 1.5)\nend\n\n-- Centre of a GUI object on screen, handy as a floatText position.\nfunction Effects.centreOf(gui: GuiObject): Vector2\n\treturn gui.AbsolutePosition + gui.AbsoluteSize / 2\nend\n\nreturn Effects\n"); print("Guess & Draw installed! Press Play to test.")
